s/7db8585d7b03c01bee9d4afc2ea3af500992e728/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T00:40:48Z","email":"admin@loci.world","name":"Keni Lam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T00:40:48Z","email":"admin@loci.world","name":"Keni Lam"},"message":"fix: a new floor empties the simulator''s cells, and a restarted arm takes over like a switch\n\nSwitching simulations with the arms on the bridge left the floor before''s\ncases standing in the simulator under this floor''s ids, so perception\nmoved the hub''s cases metres away and the vacuum took the wrong ones.\nLoading a cell now stages its pallets and belt pads with no cases, which\ndrops the rest. An arm that restarts under a running hub is seeded with\nwhere it stood and what it held and carries its job on from its step,\ninstead of being greeted bare and losing the case.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"09bb65807afe7aeb61b6af124eca3f012bd8f7ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/git/trees/09bb65807afe7aeb61b6af124eca3f012bd8f7ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/git/commits/7db8585d7b03c01bee9d4afc2ea3af500992e728","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141117197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/loci-admin","id":141117197,"login":"loci-admin","node_id":"U_kgDOCGlHDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/repos","site_a