min@loci.world","name":"Keni Lam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T00:35:58Z","email":"admin@loci.world","name":"Keni Lam"},"message":"fix: the physics catch up before a descent, and may run faster than the model to do so\n\nA swing is passed through only into another swing: before a descent the\nphysical arm has to be at the top of it, or the pad came down wherever\nthe physics still were, into the cases beside the spot. The simulated\njoints may now turn half again as fast as the model, so trailing it\nthrough a swing is something they can make up.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a3eb4654a85416e303bb857439efa8e401862f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/git/trees/7a3eb4654a85416e303bb857439efa8e401862f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/git/commits/a70bf910598ec0c78ce50854ba02d5e4bc227069","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141117197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/loci-admin","id":141117197,"login":"loci-admin","node_id":"U_kgDOCGlHDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://gi