hen for half a second of stillness, so the arm went in\nstops and starts. A physical arm has now arrived when its pad is within\n3 cm of the goal, 10 cm through a swing. Its swings also go 12 cm\nhigher than the model''s, since it runs that much lower and clipped the\ncases it swung over, and the simulator''s drives are stiffer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4dcb60c51cd1e5727dc508e6e56f2e61972aae22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/git/trees/4dcb60c51cd1e5727dc508e6e56f2e61972aae22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/git/commits/6e3034b8fcd291f428222b83c38a944f14716d14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141117197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/loci-admin","id":141117197,"login":"loci-admin","node_id":"U_kgDOCGlHDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/commit/6e3034b8fcd291f428222b83c38a944f14716d14","node_id":"C_kwDOUx14ANoAKDZlMzAzNGI4ZmNkMjkxZjQyODIyMmI4M2MzOGE5NDRmMTQ3MTZkMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/commit/fa9d7e274b9963379a