 new controller with the joints the old one reported, so\nthe picture holds still and the plan starts from there.\n\nA case swinging on the vacuum joint kept the roll jittering, so the\nphysical arm never counted as stopped and a move whose pad had arrived\nwaited for ever. Stillness is now the pad''s, not the joints''.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1aaeb29202fe05c5180c2b51a406676d4c295fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/git/trees/b1aaeb29202fe05c5180c2b51a406676d4c295fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/git/commits/27d321ea1f2f4d70d038d9240e63e3f4299f97a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141117197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/loci-admin","id":141117197,"login":"loci-admin","node_id":"U_kgDOCGlHDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/commit/27d321ea1f2f4d70d038d9240e63e3f4299f97a6","node_id":"C_kwDOUx14ANoAKDI3ZDMyMWVhMWYyZjRkNzBkMDM4ZDkyNDBlNjNlM2Y0Mjk5Zjk3YTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/commit/322719679861b24ec4cdc9508ec4cb29cf763331","sha":"322719679861b24ec4cdc9508ec4cb29cf763331","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/commits/322719679861b24ec4cdc9508ec4cb29cf763331"}],"sha":"27d321ea1f2f4d70d038d9240e63e3f4299f97a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/commits/27d321ea1f2f4d70d038d9240e63e3f4299f97a6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141117197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/loci-admin","id":141117197,"login":"loci-admin","node_id":"U_kgDOCGlHDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/commits/322719679861b24ec4cdc9508ec4cb29cf763331/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:40:24Z","email":"admin@loci.world","name":"Keni Lam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T21:40:24Z","email":"admin@loci.world","name":"Keni Lam"},"message":"feat(station): a relink takes effect at once\n\nThe swap used to wait for the moment between jobs, so switching Physical\nAI on left the old arm finishing its drop first, then swung the new one\nhome before it went on. Now the new arm takes over as soon as it is\nlinked: a case on the old pad goes back where it stood, the order goes\nback to the front of the queue, and the new arm plans it from where it\nis, with no homing swing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"570fe3eb5e0cf7f57696d9de537a46db87b1435e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/git/trees/570fe3eb5e0cf7f57696d9de537a46db87b1435e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/git/commits/322719679861b24ec4cdc9508ec4cb29cf763331","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141117197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/loci-admin","id":141117197,"login":"loci-admin","node_id":"U_kgDOCGlHDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/commit/322719679861b24ec4cdc9508ec4cb29cf763331","node_id":"C_kwDOUx14ANoAKDMyMjcxOTY3OTg2MWIyNGVjNGNkYzk1MDhlYzRjYjI5Y2Y3NjMzMzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/commit/9f76e880c60b7bfab8ae25de5fbb39c5ec8c20bc","sha":"9f76e880c60b7bfab8ae25de5fbb39c5ec8c20bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/commits/9f76e880c60b7bfab8ae25de5fbb39c5ec8c20bc"}],"sha":"322719679861b24ec4cdc9508ec4cb29cf763331","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.