the simulator\n\nA case taken off the belt was staged at the belt''s height with nothing\nunder it, so it fell before the vacuum reached it and every pick off a\nline found nothing. The hub now sends a pad of belt under the pick zone\nand each drop, and the simulator stages them as static boxes. The whole\nrun is not sent: a belt on a slant would be one box across half the cell.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ee8d129657ddaea6712c2c25f0789bd37dc18ee5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/git/trees/ee8d129657ddaea6712c2c25f0789bd37dc18ee5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/git/commits/4f1e44a222dbaaa7380780e58bcce63cfbac7f33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141117197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/loci-admin","id":141117197,"login":"loci-admin","node_id":"U_kgDOCGlHDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/commit/4f1e44a222dbaaa7380780e58bcce63cfbac7f33","node_id":"C_kwDOUx14ANoAKDRmMWU0NGEyMjJkYmFhYTczODA3ODBlNThiY2NlNjNjZmJhYzdmMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://git