iptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/commits/90fed60522e536c42ba742fdfa8c604a82ac69b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T18:28:41Z","email":"admin@loci.world","name":"Keni Lam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T18:28:41Z","email":"admin@loci.world","name":"Keni Lam"},"message":"fix: a bridge that comes back is greeted again, and the sim finds the gripper by name\n\nThe socket to the bridge reconnects on its own, but the arms behind a\nrestarted bridge know nothing: no scene, no revision. Every station now\ngreets its arm again when the socket reopens, with its obstacles, cases\nand pallets first.\n\nThe URDF importer nests the links its own way, so `/World/arm_a/gripper`\nwas not a prim. The cell now finds the rigid body named gripper under the\narm, and a failing callback is a log line instead of the end of the run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"86952d9c7d8d45ed58be2be33b3db188b66c77a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/git/trees/86952d9c7d8d45ed58be2be33b3db188b66c77a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/git/commits/90fed60522e536c42ba742fdfa8c604a82ac69b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141117197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/loci-admin","id":141117197,"login":"loci-admin","node_id":"U_kgDOCGlHDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/loci-admin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/commit/90fed60522e536c42ba742fdfa8c604a82ac69b0","node_id":"C_kwDOUx14ANoAKDkwZmVkNjA1MjJlNTM2YzQyYmE3NDJmZGZhOGM2MDRhODJhYzY5YjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/commit/3efa406ede7ed62540cd6028fe7894c287ce1185","sha":"3efa406ede7ed62540cd6028fe7894c287ce1185","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/commits/3efa406ede7ed62540cd6028fe7894c287ce1185"}],"sha":"90fed60522e536c42ba742fdfa8c604a82ac69b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/commits/90fed60522e536c42ba742fdfa8c604a82ac69b0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/657845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam","id":657845,"login":"kenilam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1Nzg0NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/commits/3efa406ede7ed62540cd6028fe7894c287ce1185/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T18:19:41Z","email":"hello@ki-cl.com","name":"Keni Lam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T18:19:41Z","email":"hello@ki-cl.com","name":"Keni Lam"},"message":"feat: the cell as physics: cases and pallets in the simulator, and a vacuum that takes them\n\nThe scene the hub feeds an arm now carries the cases and pallets in its cell\nas boxes, next to the obstacles its sensors meet; the hub sends it on every\ncell change. Over ROS the bridge passes them on as JSON on /<arm>/cell and\nthe vacuum''s state on /<arm>/vacuum, both latched. The simulator stages\npallets as fixed boxes and cases as rigid ones where the hub first says they\nare, then leaves them to the physics; when the vacuum comes on it takes the\ncase under the pad with a fixed joint, and lets go when it goes off. A case\nthe hub stops listing is removed unless the vacuum holds it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48a2fdda9978529501b21271c158cf0ea194397d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/git/trees/48a2fdda9978529501b21271c158cf0ea194397d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/git/commits/3efa406ede7ed62540cd6028fe7894c287ce1185","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/657845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam","id":657845,"login":"kenilam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1Nzg0NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/received_events","