b834731e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T17:27:44Z","email":"hello@ki-cl.com","name":"Keni Lam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T17:27:44Z","email":"hello@ki-cl.com","name":"Keni Lam"},"message":"feat(gcp): ROS 2 for Isaac Sim''s bridge, over UDP\n\nThe runner gives the simulator the Jazzy libraries it bundles and the UDP-only\nFast DDS profile the Isaac ROS CLI installs. Without it another container\nlists the simulator''s topics but never receives a message: shared memory\ndoes not cross between containers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b0de543f2055747edfe99eba80359d4110bc8ff5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/git/trees/b0de543f2055747edfe99eba80359d4110bc8ff5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/git/commits/43fe869afcf18e931a79de91bc70075eb834731e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/657845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam","id":657845,"login":"kenilam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1Nzg0NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenilam","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kenilam/Ki.CL-arm/commit/43fe869afcf18e931a79de91b