 and migrate ConfirmModal buttons (#38153)\n\n* Add @mattermost/compass-ui@alpha and migrate ConfirmModal buttons.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Bump @mattermost/compass-ui to 0.1.0-alpha.1.\n\nAlign ConfirmModal button emphasis props with lowercase kebab-case API.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Fix ConfirmModal SCSS property order for stylelint.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Bump @mattermost/compass-ui to 0.1.0-alpha.2.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Remove local compass-ui smoke panel from PR.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Fix ConfirmModal SCSS padding/gap property order.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Bump compass-ui to alpha.3 and use Button subpath imports.\n\nAdd Jest moduleNameMapper for compass-ui CJS subpaths so ConfirmModal tests avoid loading the root barrel.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Fix Jest compass-ui moduleNameMapper path for channels install.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Update ConfirmModal consumer tests for compass-ui Button markup.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Update ResetStatusModal snapshots for compass-ui Button markup.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Fix missing newline at end of burn_on_read confirmation test.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Bump @mattermost/compass-ui to 0.1.0-alpha.4.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Bump @mattermost/compass-ui to 0.1.0-alpha.5.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Update ConfirmModal snapshots for compass-ui alpha.5 CSS hashes.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Bump @mattermost/compass-ui to 0.1.0-alpha.6.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Bump @mattermost/compass-ui to 0.1.0-alpha.7\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update jest.config.js\n\n* Bump @mattermost/compass-ui to 0.1.0-alpha.9\n\nalpha.9 fixes CSS module re-processing in webpack consumers — component\nstyles are now distributed as plain .css files so per-component style\nloading works correctly without a global bundle import. Remove the\nnow-redundant component-styles import from entry.tsx.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update LeaveChannelModal snapshot for compass-ui alpha.9 class hashes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update ResetStatusModal snapshot for compass-ui alpha.9 class hashes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update snapshots to compass-ui alpha.9 doayp class hashes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix indentation in jest.config.js moduleNameMapper\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Bump @mattermost/compass-ui to 0.1.0-alpha.10\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix marketplace Cypress confirm selector after ConfirmModal Button migration.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <2040554+matthewbirtch@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a6b1649e6db4a50398999b9cf68d02cb1e8cd70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/trees/4a6b1649e6db4a50398999b9cf68d02cb1e8cd70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/commits/70658e18d4c6234765af050d051fb1a8a7b2e31f","verification":{"payload":"tree 4a6b1649e6db4a50398999b9cf68d02cb1e8cd70\nparent 3348d7dfd1e4b657ef3303889cabd2b0a107c6a5\nauthor Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com> 1790626652 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790626652 -0400\n\nAdd @mattermost/compass-ui@0.1.0-alpha.10 and migrate ConfirmModal buttons (#38153)\n\n* Add @mattermost/compass-ui@alpha and migrate ConfirmModal buttons.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Bump @mattermost/compass-ui to 0.1.0-alpha.1.\n\nAlign ConfirmModal button emphasis props with lowercase kebab-case API.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Fix ConfirmModal SCSS property order for stylelint.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Bump @mattermost/compass-ui to 0.1.0-alpha.2.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Remove local compass-ui smoke panel from PR.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Fix ConfirmModal SCSS padding/gap property order.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Bump compass-ui to alpha.3 and use Button subpath imports.\n\nAdd Jest moduleNameMapper for compass-ui CJS subpaths so ConfirmModal tests avoid loading the root barrel.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Fix Jest compass-ui moduleNameMapper path for channels install.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Update ConfirmModal consumer tests for compass-ui Button markup.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Update ResetStatusModal snapshots for compass-ui Button markup.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Fix missing newline at end of burn_on_read confirmation test.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Bump @mattermost/compass-ui to 0.1.0-alpha.4.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Bump @mattermost/compass-ui to 0.1.0-alpha.5.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Update ConfirmModal snapshots for compass-ui alpha.5 CSS hashes.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Bump @mattermost/compass-ui to 0.1.0-alpha.6.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Bump @mattermost/compass-ui to 0.1.0-alpha.7\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update jest.config.js\n\n* Bump @mattermost/compass-ui to 0.1.0-alpha.9\n\nalpha.9 fixes CSS module re-processing in webpack consumers — component\nstyles are now distributed as plain .css files so per-component style\nloading works correctly without a global bundle import. Remove the\nnow-redundant component-styles import from entry.tsx.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update LeaveChannelModal snapshot for compass-ui alpha.9 class hashes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update ResetStatusModal snapshot for compass-ui alpha.9 class hashes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update snapshots to compass-ui alpha.9 doayp class hashes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix indentation in jest.config.js moduleNameMapper\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Bump @mattermost/compass-ui to 0.1.0-alpha.10\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix marketplace Cypress confirm selector after ConfirmModal Button migration.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <2040554+matthewbirtch@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqustcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuGMQAGZgT96tER3+HPopy/UerMYk\nhVv735o2q/H7TpxoNLoS0hP+V6+HFhVa2LpCbDJoNAz4wKufBZxFTeiAvu8S//JM\nBDKrTWcEjPrB7MAl93h8d98k0F8PfCeQ/THfuLanhhO2eZsoQKyoA6DTk4L9UK+S\ntx2AAVZLrnbGwWeppHSA6+Zn/zKNA5iuj5iMRLvCmdAHjw+fAlo9XLYuYz0xQd4o\nMjct2UmZcHKUySMoVWFDXCgBJdbNq0JuBQgBJioZOQViGM7RYM/6CaF4BYf/OhOX\nT0pgx4GOuyJsbfPQVJZhV9l7iNdgAR+51M78+SeBcV+wktMHBjoClGA9CTgMfbMX\nWxvzU4GlpsU6rIi/pK5m3IeRR9Uv9MdJZ3iFxOqiMuERyJ5vwded1dLnfm/JdpGu\nnGiApOKBF5YMd9KQS0ubHs0Z+4aQBwuoQgK8N/LN/wgWjpnpBsxj8iDVbfo1mJ5f\nd556HLD2muIgfvsiL9e37VhwVpTMxHc1KMNBZ6IlLceSMs4QMC55ce6M1M+2v+JE\n8j3sIoYkeW8oudGoZs5agAMW1vhifY1m