 cache invalidation comments\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Keep channel index on soft webconn cache invalidation\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: David Krauser <david@krauser.org>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"a83b54de6525a7945f4fc6dd9f35706c9981955c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/trees/a83b54de6525a7945f4fc6dd9f35706c9981955c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/commits/3b20966b6108e4fdb58773d8409ae4e37ca31001","verification":{"payload":"tree a83b54de6525a7945f4fc6dd9f35706c9981955c\nparent 9026858eb61bc4418dd9071a287cba07aaf9dd2f\nauthor Edgar Bellot Micó <edgar.bellotmico@mattermost.com> 1790358996 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790358996 -0400\n\nMM-69996: Fix session cache invalidation not fully propagating to websocket connections (#37716)\n\n* MM-69996: Fix session cache invalidation not fully propagating to websocket connections\n\nSee MM-69996 for more details.\n\n* Move InvalidateAllCaches webconn test to app package\n\nThe platform test suite stubs GetSession, so it cannot exercise\nre-validation against the session store. Test through DeleteOAuthApp\nwith the real app instead.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Trim webconn cache invalidation comments\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Keep channel index on soft webconn cache invalidation\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: David Krauser <david@krauser.org>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtrXUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAf3QQAAqWlbLUm+QTcspiSk8c/zMA\nIw5frSWnVDvqHhgah7WkOLhrJsbEqOcu1QiiY/cFOcbqYb1BaEqKC/G/A0UnRpz4\npSjCF2x+nnLLy92EwKneT6kklwptaj5iwrLdbIsqcxAdX4y/ome0DW2oxBSxYWhq\nZn6RmM5iwya0gCoUJvgkmAo9ZxvkUfiEHWHy3RHlOy4+gwus0VT23s1OIz61d3H5\n14ElxX