ore-info/\n- /contribute/                             -> /developers/contribute/\n- /extend/plugins/server/reference/        -> /developers/integrate/reference/server\n- /extend/plugins/                         -> /developers/integrate/plugins/\n- /integrate/admin-guide/admin-bot-accounts/           -> /developers/integrate/reference/bot-accounts/\n- /integrate/admin-guide/admin-personal-access-token/  -> /developers/integrate/reference/personal-access-token/\n- /integrate/admin-guide/admin-plugins-beta/           -> /developers/integrate/plugins/using-and-managing-plugins\n- /integrate/other-integrations/customization/         -> /developers/integrate/customization/customization/\n- /integrate/other-integrations/                       -> /developers/integrate/\n- /integrate/                              -> /developers/integrate/\n\nLeft untouched:\n- developers.mattermost.com/blog/... (blog was not part of the docs\n  migration and still resolves at the old host).\n\n* docs: drop link to unmigrated developer blog post on LDAP nested groups\n\n* docs: point bare /developers/integrate/ refs at /getting-started, fix Ths typo\n\n- /developers/integrate/ 404s (there is no landing page for the section);\n  route the four ''for more details'' references from the integrations\n  configuration settings and onboarding/rollout content to\n  /developers/integrate/getting-started/ instead.\n- Fix ''Ths'' -> ''This'' in the post-proxy relay guidance in the mobile FAQ.","tree":{"sha":"1a0dcfa6b26bca3e2d7f56b07c1c049d67a6524c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/trees/1a0dcfa6b26bca3e2d7f56b07c1c049d67a6524c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/commits/923df3deba0c852772c8b9fd7f225a15f1fe5246","verification":{"payload":"tree 1a0dcfa6b26bca3e2d7f56b07c1c049d67a6524c\nparent cb4254cc2d14902227540a29aafa0eeb15da5171\nauthor Eva Sarafianou <eva.sarafianou@gmail.com> 1790245343 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 179024534