1960768853eec8166cdcf1f5786d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/commits/b94495ffc9e21960768853eec8166cdcf1f5786d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2040554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewbirtch/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewbirtch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewbirtch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewbirtch/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matthewbirtch","id":2040554,"login":"matthewbirtch","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDA1NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewbirtch/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewbirtch/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewbirtch/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewbirtch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewbirtch/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewbirtch","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/commits/df20dd76df11a6e8ff7d0b9da010a54fc90a736e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T20:17:37Z","email":"mattbirtch@gmail.com","name":"Matthew Birtch"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T20:17:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Show out-of-office notice above DM composer (#38635)\n\n* MM: Show out-of-office notice above DM composer\n\nExpose auto-responder messages on OOO user statuses and display a\nbanner above the DM post input with the auto-reply text on hover.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Color OOO notice icon with error-text to match DND\n\nKeep muted gray label text; only the icon uses --error-text.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Revert OOO notice icon to inherit muted text color\n\nDrop the error-text icon tint so the banner matches the original muted styling.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Fix import order for OutOfOfficeWarning\n\nSatisfy eslint import/order in advanced_text_editor.tsx.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Add Cypress coverage for DM out-of-office composer notice\n\nAssert the OOO banner appears above the DM input and that hovering\nit shows the auto-reply message in a tooltip.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Fix Status test literals after AutoResponderMessage field\n\nConvert positional Status composites in status_test.go to keyed\nfields so golangci-lint typecheck and server tests compile.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Address OOO notice review: DND restore enrichment and a11y\n\nEnrich restored statuses after timed DND expiry so OOO broadcasts\ninclude auto_responder_message, and make the tooltip label\nkeyboard-focusable when a message is present.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Assert AutoResponderMessage survives Status JSON round-trip\n\nCover the new Status field in TestStatus and TestStatusListToJSON.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* gofmt status_test.go struct field alignment\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Hide off-hours notice when DM OOO banner is shown\n\nThe out-of-office composer notice replaces RemoteUserHour so both\ndo not appear together above the DM input.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Fix Cypress OOO tooltip assertion for WithTooltip\n\nFocus the banner tooltip trigger instead of mouseenter on a\nnon-reference parent, and assert via .tooltipContainer. Wrap\nWithTooltip around the full OOO banner so hover/focus targets match.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Drop OOO tooltip and status auto-responder enrichment\n\nRemove auto_responder_message from the status hot path and websocket\npayload so DM OOO notice is banner-only for V1. This avoids extra\nuser lookups on every status poll.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"64518edfe57484da726818735a514209e8809aa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/trees/64518edfe57484da726818735a514209e8809aa5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/commits/df20dd76df11a6e8ff7d0b9da010a54fc90a736e","verification":{"payload":"tree 64518edfe57484da726818735a514209e8809aa5\nparent 8ddcd797c7a5801c04831fbbd9104193d1c6015a\nauthor Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com> 1790194657 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790194657 -0400\n\nShow out-of-office notice above DM composer (#38635)\n\n* MM: Show out-of-office notice above DM composer\n\nExpose auto-responder messages on OOO user statuses and display a\nbanner above the DM post input with the auto-reply text on hover.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Color OOO notice icon with error-text to match DND\n\nKeep muted gray label text; only the icon uses --error-text.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Revert OOO notice icon to inherit muted text color\n\nDrop the error-text icon tint so the banner matches the original muted styling.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Fix import order for OutOfOfficeWarning\n\nSatisfy eslint import/order in advanced_text_editor.tsx.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Add Cypress coverage for DM out-of-office composer notice\n\nAssert the OOO banner appears above the DM input and that hovering\nit shows the auto-reply message in a tooltip.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Fix Status test literals after AutoResponderMessage field\n\nConvert positional Status composites in status_test.go to keyed\nfields so golangci-lint typecheck and server tests compile.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Address OOO notice review: DND restore enrichment and a11y\n\nEnrich restored statuses after timed DND expiry so OOO broadcasts\ninclude auto_responder_message, and make the tooltip label\nkeyboard-focusable when a message is present.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Assert AutoResponderMessage survives Status JSON round-trip\n\nCover the new Status field in TestStatus and TestStatusListToJSON.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* gofmt status_test.go struct field alignment\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Hide off-hours notice when DM OOO banner is shown\n\nThe out-of-office composer notice replaces RemoteUserHour so both\ndo not appear together above the DM input.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Fix Cypress OOO tooltip assertion for WithTooltip\n\nFocus the banner tooltip trigger instead of mouseenter on a\nnon-reference parent, and assert via .tooltipContainer. Wrap\nWithTooltip around the full OOO banner so hover/focus targets match.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Drop OOO tooltip and status auto-responder enrichment\n\nRemove auto_responder_message from the status hot path and websocket\npayload so DM OOO notice is banner-only for V1. This avoids extra\nuser lookups on every status poll.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtDPhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAh6AQADUdswGP6ACGoIZ8kGmjQUz2\nlr6XIf7j8uY68+R9TeucWRXZY+2BYpKfuOfWCMwYxMKxwisEI/tyZOsxedhRx3KK\ndQOzdqznW8DiC6YcrkgQz6FE88ZMTGFKCPZoO5xoZ9lj+xxLxDVPjWrU4OBa7e/R\nBH/8QLkNoIq4jAnv/z3lr/pi97/lgQ6wVrQYTEU1gSMWImOiSe1NwtRY3Fvkd1IB\nS9mUOLN45zYWymT0FpTZFcsOlhxjV2MR944GPy