-by: Eva Sarafianou <eva.sarafianou@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: coderabbitai[bot] <136622811+coderabbitai[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Eva Sarafianou <eva.sarafianou@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"f05ca200271574f43e317309719a5850ee2c0523","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/trees/f05ca200271574f43e317309719a5850ee2c0523"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/commits/86ee66a92d9187ab7e1144007d72039b9fdc1cf3","verification":{"payload":"tree f05ca200271574f43e317309719a5850ee2c0523\nparent e9a8793d555a58f40771f21d02757883c81c330b\nauthor Eric Sethna <14333569+esethna@users.noreply.github.com> 1790179283 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790179283 -0700\n\nAdd workflow to auto-label docs PRs for editor review (#38717)\n\n* Add workflow to auto-label docs PRs for editor review\n\nApply the existing \"2: Editor Review\" label when non-draft, same-repo PRs change files under docs/, so technical writers are notified without relying on the disabled docs impact review workflow.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Update .github/workflows/docs-editor-review-label.yml\n\nCo-authored-by: coderabbitai[bot] <136622811+coderabbitai[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Update .github/workflows/docs-editor-review-label.yml\n\nCo-authored-by: Eva Sarafianou <eva.sarafianou@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: coderabbitai[bot] <136622811+coderabbitai[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Eva Sarafianou <eva.sarafianou@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqs/fTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbtkQAK85x69P4IbXFL9JZ8uH4xOs\noOVUWQ/nnOTjhopq102OOxYn9LkCsehsTAbSLhTHczSlEBTY5pJHJKp6B7arqXnL\nGxabbrTrbtU41w0Xzg4relmMZKZgKwoyP8FDPARwjjXxUwNGXCwNJP/DNK8l83OV\npgpjUT9HCFFfLOBIRI7E5ushRrYVzxie6VHWqFZseGb3OZ63Wy2MTHVHmQNIp+Ha\nf9bS27ScgN