or%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/cursor","id":206951365,"login":"cursor[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDODFXTxQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/commits/ab7d2b5db5ec0f076e98ac8aabc7216e9d003b0d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:06:06Z","email":"206951365+cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cursor[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:06:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[MM-70804] Stop the attribute Type menu offering conversions to or from Hierarchical (#38697)\n\nChanging an existing attribute''s Type to or from Hierarchical on the\nSystem Console''s Attribute Management page always failed at Save with a\n400 (app.property_field.update.graph_type_change.app_error): the server\nrefuses that conversion in either direction, because a flat option list\nand a hierarchy do not describe the same values.\n\nThe Type menu offered it anyway. It now only offers types a PATCH can\nactually reach -- Hierarchical is dropped from the menu when editing an\nexisting non-Hierarchical attribute, and an existing Hierarchical\nattribute has its Type control locked behind a tooltip saying so. Both\ndirections stay available on the create form, and a Hierarchical\nattribute remains editable in every other respect.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b57db55a853c1c7615161cd5fd27b0bba221de3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/trees/5b57db55a853c1c7615161cd5fd27b0bba221de3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/commits/ab7d2b5db5ec0f076e98ac8aabc7216e9d003b0d","verification":{"payload":"tree 5b57db55a853c1c7615161cd5fd27b0bba221de3\nparent 6cd323d1544b679697f103361f31809a0e2f2c50\nauthor cursor[bot] <206951365+cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1790175966 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790175966 -0400\n\n[MM-70804] Stop the attribute Type menu offering conversions to or from Hierarchical (#38697)\n\nChanging an existing attribute''s Type to or from Hierarchical on the\nSystem Console''s Attribute Management page always failed at Save with a\n400 (app.property_field.update.graph_type_change.app_error): the server\nrefuses that conversion in either direction, because a flat option list\nand a hierarchy do not describe the same values.\n\nThe Type menu offered it anyway. It now only offers types a PATCH can\nactually reach -- Hierarchical is dropped from the menu when editing an\nexisting non-Hierarchical attribute, and an existing Hierarchical\nattribute has its Type control locked behind a tooltip saying so. Both\ndirections stay available on the create form, and a Hierarchical\nattribute remains editable in every other respect.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqs+reCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgYsQADmGTpbc6BV9M/BkzE6vFXJY\n034y7lnrVzpvF5s5yLp5RjoNH8mVf1TnCCMe9yyf9MOc4Z5Hb9mpbDT6Agl8Axo6\n1jeUP7+fdhy9I2k0E33bqNd7Sb/laNZdVBEYkszBbLNavXwLxvfpgpHF2poaigmj\nSvIb/uo0ZSRZEXw3k2YuveaW7s0DlPY+GztfvihHSZBFg5po2P6+UH8QrOS7r4mE\nqxd5gatGpANalW3pA+IxXYvG