pi.github.com/users/mgdelacroix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgdelacroix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgdelacroix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgdelacroix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgdelacroix","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/commits/bb72eeb7b23438efbec04a224b28b00d4552af64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T13:21:20Z","email":"miguel@mcrx.me","name":"Miguel de la Cruz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T13:21:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Allow to hydrate posts with their attributes (#38134)\n\n* Updates post metadata and PreparePostForClient opts, adds tests\n\n* Add per-target property field cap and apply it to post attributes\n\n* Allows SearchPropertyValues to target master with the context mechanism\n\n* Add opt-in post property value hydration to GET /posts/{id}\n\n* Add opt-in post property value hydration to GetPostsForChannel and GetPostThread\n\n* Add opt-in post property value hydration to the webapp client\n\n* Update include_property_groups to be includePropertyGroups\n\n* Updates API docs to match the implementation\n\n* Update query parameter naming and remove multiple group support\n\n* Fix property value type in the docs\n\n* Add tests for the post property value hydration bounds\n\n* Fix e2e flaky test\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Miguel de la Cruz <miguel@ctrlz.es>","tree":{"sha":"d4ba26d5df4713c3dc56fcb40bb7295ad2ac7b22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/trees/d4ba26d5df4713c3dc56fcb40bb7295ad2ac7b22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/commits/bb72eeb7b23438efbec04a224b28b00d4552af64","verification":{"payload":"tree d4ba26d5df4713c3dc56fcb40bb7295ad2ac7b22\nparent 8a3fcb5a65a99a5ffa9df73233bf15bba268800a\nautho