tar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/esarafianou","id":17114347,"login":"esarafianou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTE0MzQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esarafianou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esarafianou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esarafianou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esarafianou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esarafianou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/esarafianou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/commits/9900413b43fd6653d2a101e8afa8e3f088cdbfa7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T10:12:48Z","email":"eva.sarafianou@gmail.com","name":"Eva Sarafianou"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T10:12:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"security: bump dependencies (#38705)\n\n* security: bump golang.org/x/crypto to v0.56.0\n\nFixes two DoS vulnerabilities in the SSH package. The vulnerable\npackage golang.org/x/crypto/ssh is not directly imported by\nmattermost; the module is pulled in transitively via other x/crypto\nsubpackages so the affected functions are not reachable at runtime,\nbut bumping keeps the dependency clean of known advisories.\n\n- CVE-2026-56855 / GO-2026-6355: DoS on deadlocked established channel\n- CVE-2026-78662 / GO-2026-6354: DoS on deadlocked undecided channel\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* security: bump google.golang.org/grpc to v1.83.2\n\nFixes a DoS panic in the xDS server routing interceptor when a request\nis received without both the :authority and Host headers. Mattermost\nimports grpc only transitively and does not construct servers via\nxds.NewGRPCServer, so the vulnerable code path is unreachable in the\nMattermost binary, but the transitive dependency is bumped to keep\nthe module clean of known advisories.\n\n- CVE-2026-84445 / GHSA-2v4p-qf9q-27wj / GO-2026-6443\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* security: bump x/crypto to v0.57.0 and grpc to v1.84.0\n\nRoll both dependencies forward from the initial minimum-fix versions\n(v0.56.0 and v1.83.2) to the current latest stable releases, picking\nup all interim fixes at once so the scanner does not re-open these\nrows on the next patch cycle.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c4120a7caf51a5fda7684cd7c98d7657241e473","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/trees/0c4120a7caf51a5fda7684cd7c98d7657241e473"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/commits/9900413b43fd6653d2a101e8afa8e3f088cdbfa7","verification":{"payload":"tree 0c4120a7caf51a5fda7684cd7c98d7657241e473\nparent 909cadce5e26397239122222273a660b33a62d5e\nauthor Eva Sarafianou <eva.sarafianou@gmail.com> 1790071968 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790071968 +0300\n\nsecurity: bump dependencies (#38705)\n\n* security: bump golang.org/x/crypto to v0.56.0\n\nFixes two DoS vulnerabilities in the SSH package. The vulnerable\npackage golang.org/x/crypto/ssh is not directly imported by\nmattermost; the module is pulled in transitively via other x/crypto\nsubpackages so the affected functions are not reachable at runtime,\nbut bumping keeps the dependency clean of known advisories.\n\n- CVE-2026-56855 / GO-2026-6355: DoS on deadlocked established channel\n- CVE-2026-78662 / GO-2026-6354: DoS on deadlocked undecided channel\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* security: bump google.golang.org/grpc to v1.83.2\n\nFixes a DoS panic in the xDS server routing interceptor when a request\nis received without both the :authority and Host headers. Mattermost\nimports grpc only transitively and does not construct servers via\nxds.NewGRPCServer, so the vulnerable code path is unreachable in the\nMattermost binary, but the transitive dependency is bumped to keep\nthe module clean of known advisories.\n\n- CVE-2026-84445 / GHSA-2v4p-qf9q-27wj / GO-2026-6443\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* security: bump x/crypto to v0.57.0 and grpc to v1.84.0\n\nRoll both dependencies forward from the initial minimum-fix versions\n(v0.56.0 and v1.83.2) to the current latest stable releases, picking\nup all interim fixes at once so the scanner does not re-open these\nrows on the next patch cycle.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqslSgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAghEQAJSYpSYK/8XpEqoxlsIksXT/\nfTZiGfln2TZYFC4i2ECrDocKaHIaK054/ZK/DkHhMLyJG7LVBPlyRF/I53IG+hhu\n2ZR5vLXSwD/CBQWn7VST0ii/EmtbMouvA0KsBDXYoEEIV8dwatR8UsP0MzcSIadO\ncJZ3N+TG1h6H/wLO4t9Qp2+E+t8L+hxIYtYkBSLvpKVv37e0qmD9nhum3QwqZ6eU\nThNXUrfRp00uoxV9w4+PTno+Y63RdF9C9O0LdsIXcn1M6m09GG/jQweqZ3y6B9l0\nVuhfU9rxTl5yCV+/9l2X5a06RN9IvmfbquYtRm8gVs00fZ7A9qBe9lQAzhg48lDQ\n0Atiu1pkcTnu1i3L4/7wLyxfBRUCMedjkhUmo/yHc5TPQ3s3PzT6V0DvFafVcsth\n5tC+D2tJLlWyF5WGtWUR3eQxzX2yV5JlHkvf7z7r2h720lnkJSYIz3IReBHxcw23\nmN1FtkTw4aVnX9XHixYOXSfbGc7vb0R4Hewsgtlt2eGlC/dduh0fFs4Y4FZxsSP6\nYKR+IDodUza/orAs+P44QMH2KvUFonWM70Pi+/ea/frOg6fQTAuTm02uhOw8FXyJ\n3oavFX1Iv2jkiRVhTUAhxKbVkrZO8ZQo7bgfHD2AO6sDkE28jc7lf/K9bfuR/d/Q\nAkj/K0fIbRX2sObHjpLN\n=OLJx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T10:05:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow",