","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/commit/6ee80ce049fe86c5bff11b8dde6c391414f253a8","node_id":"C_kwDOUyPM59oAKDZlZTgwY2UwNDlmZTg2YzViZmYxMWI4ZGRlNmMzOTE0MTRmMjUzYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/commit/2edc236f238bc5e21d0e223046bfdbb0210d63a3","sha":"2edc236f238bc5e21d0e223046bfdbb0210d63a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/commits/2edc236f238bc5e21d0e223046bfdbb0210d63a3"}],"sha":"6ee80ce049fe86c5bff11b8dde6c391414f253a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/commits/6ee80ce049fe86c5bff11b8dde6c391414f253a8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5334504?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saturninoabril","id":5334504,"login":"saturninoabril","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMzQ1MDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/commits/2edc236f238bc5e21d0e223046bfdbb0210d63a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T12:13:40Z","email":"5334504+saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"sabril"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T12:13:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[E2E/Playwright] Add LDAP login, filter, and System Console tests (#38516)\n\n* Add Playwright LDAP login, filter, and System Console tests, delete ported Cypress specs\n\nAdds LDAP login, admin/guest/user filter, team invite, and AD/LDAP System Console\nsettings coverage. Deletes the ported Cypress LDAP specs and relocates the existing\nPlaywright LDAP login spec out of system_console.\n\nSnapshots pre-test AdminFilter/UserFilter/GuestFilter/GuestAccountsSettings.Enable\nafter ensureOpenldap and restores them in each test''s finally block, since\npatchConfig merges and would otherwise leak these into later specs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* remove unnecessary config restoration and streamline login processes\n\n* improve timeout handling; add test for SAML login rejection for unregistered users\n\n* Fix SAML+LDAP spec syntax after restack onto streamlined SAML\n\nThe LDAP timeout follow-up reintroduced finally blocks without matching\ntry statements. Drop the orphaned cleanup and keep duration.half_min.\n\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>\n\n* Prep LDAP filter config without snapshot restore\n\ninitSetup plus ensureOpenldap now establish the LDAP baseline, including\nempty GuestFilter/AdminFilter. Specs patch only the filters they need\nbefore the login steps, so later tests do not require a finally revert.\n\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>","tree":{"sha":"87c2cd147ba4a7c986e8115dc1555a05fdd3dfea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/trees/87c2cd147ba4a7c986e8115dc1555a05fdd3dfea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/commits/2edc236f238bc5e21d0e223046bfdbb0210d63a3","verification":{"payload":"tree 87c2cd147ba4a7c986e8115dc1555a05fdd3dfea\nparent c43fcbce0eb9500375e638af08aae8264ae7e7d1\nauthor sabril <5334504+saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com> 1789820020 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789820020 +0800\n\n[E2E/Playwright] Add LDAP login, filter, and System Console tests (#38516)\n\n* Add Playwright LDAP login, filter, and System Console tests, delete ported Cypress specs\n\nAdds LDAP login, admin/guest/user filter, team invite, and AD/LDAP System Console\nsettings coverage. Deletes the ported Cypress LDAP specs and relocates the existing\nPlaywright LDAP login spec out of system_console.\n\nSnapshots pre-test AdminFilter/UserFilter/GuestFilter/GuestAccountsSettings.Enable\nafter ensureOpenldap and restores them in each test''s finally block, since\npatchConfig merges and would otherwise leak these into later specs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* remove unnecessary config restoration and streamline login processes\n\n* improve timeout handling; add test for SAML login rejection for unregistered users\n\n* Fix SAML+LDAP spec syntax after restack onto streamlined SAML\n\nThe LDAP timeout follow-up reintroduced finally blocks without matching\ntry statements. Drop the orphaned cleanup and keep duration.half_min.\n\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>\n\n* Prep LDAP filter config without snapshot restore\n\ninitSetup plus ensureOpenldap now establish the LDAP baseline, including\nempty GuestFilter/AdminFilter. Specs patch only the filters they need\nbefore the login steps, so later tests do not require a finally revert.\n\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrnx0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArDEQAG7oQ/joYyaDUF7RZKpEmVuU\nmaGmtQ8546ksC7n30jzMbl9VQj7Yw20zeIXRedR7QuQvhpfOAy8GlYwq+joyRvpr\nrqZrCgtx6FCKuOxfDG/QbrnjHXarHYEBPCuwZY5dq3BFNaHr2Xh5tRueOjjkxmqr\nG4WnmWHwcTTY7NVTvtDxsp4eV5gsiZJdGlSZXj0VyBxB3zYbJRnkWxabhA0h/CmI\nsvw+UOmT8dTwk47j0JN/BovdXNsBlv0l2SJc+GITfMFMFdFvu6h/Yw4WmhzDnhP1\nzC55EOndyHCZ7zzGrTXYKcJsig8HW5OmbwoVxzZgCuV3ReWCyOEWQSknrSWy87ox\nb1ieLofR59zMSVuudORZNzjOOE0lm/rHtD9vl0cWYIQOmMGkdAmlQqFuqp2/G9v5\nYwAzhBe2QMwzHw/xD52A9uUhcn3M6yJF7O0/aS5/fdquYOWU5VMomTX/BGzKStQj\nY7/ha6nqiEtefBcywuS4rQYL1dfLhA+A37/PV9ppedU+TY3IVoOsNbd4dzwY+5bR\nVamBmynybinHk4fkms1mVhHwHh6uXPkSvJhXKN1bBma91k0e+RxSH2brKw05W0mj\nsZKZipDNNQ6iqS2IHnQYTVynCjI5I66Vgx/KScttcwg3WEGTmtjldk465bqfav1J\nJk6hTG/FUNF2nddZUDzI\n=v04B\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T10:05:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/commit/2edc236f238bc5e21d0e223046bfdbb0210d63a3","node_id":"C_kwDOUyPM59oAKDJlZGMyMzZmMjM4YmM1ZTIxZDBlMjIzMDQ2YmZkYmIwMjEwZDYzYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/commit/c43fcbce0eb9500375e638af08aae8264ae7e7d1","sha":"c43fcbce0eb9500375e638af08aae8264ae7e7d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/commits/c43fcbce0eb9500375e638af08aae8264ae7e7d1"}],"sha":"2edc236f238bc5e21d0e223046bfdbb0210d63a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/commits/2edc236f238bc5e21d0e223046bfdbb0210d63a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5334504?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saturninoabril","id":5334504,"login":"saturninoabril","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMzQ1MDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/commits/c43fcbce0eb9500375e638af08aae8264ae7e7d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T11:27:00Z","email":"5334504+saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"sabril"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T11:27:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[E2E/Playwright] Add SAML and SAML+LDAP tests and delete ported Cypress specs (#38518)\n\n* Add Playwright SAML and SAML+LDAP tests, delete ported Cypress specs\n\nAdds SAML login, metadata, signature, and guest coverage against Keycloak, plus\nSAML+LDAP sync/remove tests. Deletes the ported Cypress SAML specs and relocates\nthe existing Playwright SAML login spec out of system_console.\n\nWaits for ldap_sync jobs to finish before asserting unchanged SAML attributes,\nand snapshots SamlSettings/LdapSettings before ensureKeycloak()/ensureOpenldap()\nrun so each test restores the true pre-test config in finally, not just the\nkeys it patched itself. Bumps LDAP-sync test timeouts to 180s to cover\nrunLdapSyncAndWait''s worst case.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* streamline config handling and improve readability\n\n* refactor ldap_sync_wait to use duration constants for timeouts and improve code readability\n\n* Replace Promise.race with try/catch in Keycloak loginIfFormShown\n\nWait for the hosted username field and return if it never appears, so a\nreused IdP session does not race URL and locator waiters.\n\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>","tree":{"sha":"4bff3aa1bdc6bc5b41638c4416a91ee453a4b02e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/trees/4bff3aa1bdc6bc5b41638c4416a91ee453a4b02e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/commits/c43fcbce0eb9500375e638af08aae8264ae7e7d1","verification":{"payload":"tree 4bff3aa1bdc6bc5b41638c4416a91ee453a4b02e\nparent fa5a5a997f1296047c643654dcd3ac1ebdc57a6e\nauthor sabril <5334504+saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com> 1789817220 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789817220 +0800\n\n[E2E/Playwright] Add SAML and SAML+LDAP tests and delete ported Cypress specs (#38518)\n\n* Add Playwright SAML and SAML+LDAP tests, delete ported Cypress specs\n\nAdds SAML login, metadata, signature, and guest coverage against Keycloak, plus\nSAML+LDAP sync/remove tests. Deletes the ported Cypress SAML specs and relocates\nthe existing Playwright SAML login spec out of system_console.\n\nWaits for ldap_sync jobs to finish before asserting unchanged SAML attributes,\nand snapshots SamlSettings/LdapSettings before ensureKeycloak()/ensureOpenldap()\nrun so each test restores the true pre-test config in finally, not just the\nkeys it patched itself. Bumps LDAP-sync test timeouts to 180s to cover\nrunLdapSyncAndWait''s worst case.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* streamline config handling and improve readability\n\n* refactor ldap_sync_wait to use duration constants for timeouts and improve code readability\n\n* Replace Promise.race with try/catch in Keycloak loginIfFormShown\n\nWait for the hosted username field and return if it never appears, so a\nreused IdP session does not race URL and locator waiters.\n\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrnGECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqucQAHJ0ADR888hfqeRf/ToXl8ez\n31eLEmBUhFWl1DvzedtVtEhE0rcKCVAUbRHxa/cJ0BpR52HLJOHA3i1zp3OvCr1b\nhz7dlAXmK0xYjHzXbpdI3QK+413/OJlKMbh0OK6KCKni14OK20xSyWjjFW4M2+0u\nakKLuUyLT5k67PXzfWG12yFwhdrUD8MTCiOJfk0I00sbHzWiGJY/umFVZOgNMRJ5\n/Y3idytn4snOSZGP3j8QXvy/+Z+mc2fXGO469iXP+nulrpEE+jS+DscOUMk4FE0/\nDxfv/OhiJ3O4RsjAQ5/fF4jmw7t7VJIzTvL5pgwF6urnhmRtLG7IT+cDKcuwuSXh\nchPr0VJHyi3nAJJxN9APKWMfMXaCzOEPpfCdA