tps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5334504?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saturninoabril","id":5334504,"login":"saturninoabril","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMzQ1MDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/commits/fa5a5a997f1296047c643654dcd3ac1ebdc57a6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T09:47:15Z","email":"5334504+saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"sabril"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T09:47:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[E2E/Playwright] Add OpenID Connect login and System Console tests (#38517)\n\n* Add Playwright OpenID Connect login and System Console tests\n\nAdds login, error-path, and button-visibility coverage against Keycloak, plus\nSystem Console OpenID Connect provider-settings tests (generic/Google, GitLab,\nOffice365/Entra ID). Deletes the ported Cypress openid_spec.js.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix test with default onboarding preferences and handle config reset on afterAll\n\n* refactor createNewUserProfile to simplify onboarding options and update test cases to use default settings\n\n* Anchor OAuth login href assertions at the start of the path\n\nThe previous end-only pattern accepted any host whose path happened to\nend with the provider login URL.\n\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>\n\n* Fix OAuth login href assertion to accept absolute site URLs\n\nThe start-anchor regex only matched relative paths, but the login\nbuttons render absolute hrefs such as http://localhost:8055/oauth/google/login.\nParse the href against the page origin so the pathname must still be\nexact and off-site hosts still fail.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>","tree":{"sha":"e3e5028f26c89cd0f4d7e43ba24f73682061606a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/trees/e3e5028f26c89cd0f4d7e43ba24f73682061606a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/commits/fa5a5a997f1296047c643654dcd3ac1ebdc57a6e","verification":{"payload":"tree e3e5028f26c89cd0f4d7e43ba24f73682061606a\nparent 3aa8aa2c37ae7aedcdc0de1fe8f2430510d2f922\nauthor sabril <5334504+saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com> 1789811235 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789811235 +0800\n\n[E2E/Playwright] Add OpenID Connect login and System Console tests (#38517)\n\n* Add Playwright OpenID Connect login and System Console tests\n\nAdds login, error-path, and button-visibility coverage against Keycloak, plus\nSystem Console OpenID Connect provider-settings tests (generic/Google, GitLab,\nOffice365/Entra ID). Deletes the ported Cypress openid_spec.js.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix test with default onboarding preferences and handle config reset on afterAll\n\n* refactor createNewUserProfile to simplify onboarding options and update test cases to use default settings\n\n* Anchor OAuth login href assertions at the start of the path\n\nThe previous end-only pattern accepted any host whose path happened to\nend with the provider login URL.\n\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>\n\n* Fix OAuth login href assertion to accept absolute site URLs\n\nThe start-anchor regex only matched relative paths, but the login\nbuttons render absolute hrefs such as http://localhost:8055/oauth/google/login.\nParse the href against the page origin so the pathname must still be\nexact and off-site hosts still fail.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrlojCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2tAQAGpphkZ36chLkb8r2yqn/sle\nV6664U6lI9c/3oRZJpFk2KLJlB5zYIzU7QyKzK78U4bbOQRyvYyzBMYbbjYUDQnR\nuo50bhaOGlRtJSZ/N0rivGVpOOLlBMe3m/bl+t2dXcb0mLh7LB86R8WLuxfsai9O\nf8AXcxCamEc4oV53K9lxCqazBDQi8oaFCC6CI+xqqr0c9qlwS6CHc6GxYqRG+LRS\np05fK3T+DZfMb6FnZxE+Sk/kDei7ukSpxmlCgPvhkE+f+MfAzfoOAZ4KPlTAKyfR\nHz7AR/zGBqtkUPgTnKOjvcyJ2kyfRlZHX4jSWS2cQf3aDcaLpyHeow7lGFP4ytJt\ndmTh3342JuRGoaJaYzyM+/SQro+5hpmFWH6p1PfowmkD+NaCUGeuPoAx77LYYlfu\n8Vm8aZvx5H1XVU+4jrGiQ0NYTGGH3rOxSVbRv/mL0pg5YXwGTI0Lo28+avmiWVJJ\nk8j3wtqE9ixbbIvT0YyyFa2GERkXTHKHlGCs6Vt/fshgarOwI20NnAxGBleBPPo3\n1hKKF4BfWXZgHMfhYjYnQssatwnl/3lACIv0l+1tqZasFYeUwG0zyckUxuItM/l8\n9+s5uL6jTsLsy/UsqSzocdMbPMJcfP2UqmK1pIPpM+mFc1y4mBcsJqFxH5ok6AMB\nVU8SQPbN+OoYIuPLHa4P\n=oLBA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T10:05:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_