ved_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/commits/3aa8aa2c37ae7aedcdc0de1fe8f2430510d2f922/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T07:52:08Z","email":"5334504+saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"sabril"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T07:52:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"E2E/Playwright: Migrate active Cypress tests batch 2 (#37455)\n\nMigrate Cypress @prod coverage MM-T457 through MM-T593 into Playwright,\nincluding self/other DMs, GM membership/header/reactions, desktop and\nreply notifications, and search date-filter combinations. Retire the\nmigrated Cypress specs.\n\nRebase onto current master (including Playwright batch 1) and carry\nover later test fixes: author posts with the sender client, derive search\ndates from Date.UTC, assert multiline DM headers via innerText, and load\nthe sender profile before asserting desktop notification bodies.\n\nAssert reaction counts against the visible display number so a count of\n1 does not match 10.\n\nRemove the auto-added admin from MM-68846-T11''s private team so the\nempty-team warning is not hidden when a shared admin has Department=Engineering.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6814699f339f214f58939cf8d9bb24eedea9b6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/trees/a6814699f339f214f58939cf8d9bb24eedea9b6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/commits/3aa8aa2c37ae7aedcdc0de1fe8f2430510d2f922","verification":{"payload":"tree a6814699f339f214f58939cf8d9bb24eedea9b6b\nparent cc27323262db6414ce5794d4161e7a5b2def87ee\nauthor sabril <5334504+saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com> 1789804328 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789804328 +0800\n\nE2E/Playwright: Migrate active Cypress tests batch 2 (#37455)\n\nMigrate Cypress @prod coverage MM-T457 through MM-T593 into Playwright,\nincluding self/other DMs, GM membership/header/reactions, desktop and\nreply notifications, and search date-filter combinations. Retire the\nmigrated Cypress specs.\n\nRebase onto current master (including Playwright batch 1) and carry\nover later test fixes: author posts with the sender client, derive search\ndates from Date.UTC, assert multiline DM headers via innerText, and load\nthe sender profile before asserting desktop notification bodies.\n\nAssert reaction counts against the visible display number so a count of\n1 does not match 10.\n\nRemove the auto-added admin from MM-68846-T11''s private team so the\nempty-team warning is not hidden when a shared admin has Department=Engineering.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrj8oCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXHUQAKO+ERzHpfPaG4xPwqO8kaie\nO+jmjEnOvnkwrOVbFSrw7HPFRUztslOqjGxJ4W3wIdmNzGAFjpz9yYBKxOeVYKVK\nGQezFk8WuAog6RANGqeS2oTp3dOIl5PnnXe7g7GX8NFPndEhdqoVu2FejasmosU6\nlLFmSyRLbpDirJkmFC4eBcP2TFI7lcrfBVyLqvWhTWFbAOzzcMnGExua5nZLRI5Q\nhhbnuVfW4siD3+ZLgPsZsGftxZMQVLSCNhfE0jrx2Ehh/+bDolFDGUNJI42efodr\nM3ZiktPj46RSmouh/i58Hk9rYAmGBlgHS7yJ331EWy61nywqLbiK+KKSkpWWc+Ae\nIYdzvPQCfCnv+m4KYim/eMaA1m6crV8kWFuCn25SeEP8GWkE6CT+Q4E12dDmBsZc\nkLAsmxaXtN4a5axJZyv5RBM0PHXqmI3Lv0a5mjCeauiPDvief1N/HeCkMEq7DEt5\nZJ14csJ1a5A2dmG7bbKlQr6Ssr8UDB/uFTzicp4IhFW08S/BvDlr/1d2ffD4x0Tl\nrPHRUaaTD6WIcbEDQ9eQazQti+WYb/dGxXD5HNiFrtC0e1Fyj0uPckPsRDr+7aty\nF1RMR1DBAGwZXc796OjDt9W1ZnKicIRpbHgfgb3oI2cSIWabTwHQ1OXeg6qByRJO\nmRvmVmv/+aD74tl/3Mw5\n=K2JI\n-----END PGP