TU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agarciamontoro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agarciamontoro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agarciamontoro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agarciamontoro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agarciamontoro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/agarciamontoro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/commits/9d1aeedf12cd639e2e932d24547ab957e504000d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T13:40:13Z","email":"alejandro.garciamontoro@gmail.com","name":"Alejandro García Montoro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T13:40:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MM-70629: Emit any instead of interface{} in generated mocks (#38475)\n\n* Replace golang/mock with go.uber.org/mock\n\ngolang/mock is unmaintained and generates mocks using\ninterface{}. Switch mmctl''s mockgen and mockery''s einterfaces\nconfig to the actively maintained go.uber.org/mock fork so\nfuture-generated mocks use any instead.\n\n* Regenerate mocks with go.uber.org/mock\n\nReflect the mockgen/mockery switch in the generated output.\n\n* Remove the rest of uses of golang/mock\n\n* make generated\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mattermost Build <build@mattermost.com>","tree":{"sha":"b38bf81b5ee5f00cf379c215a95e74dde5a11798","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/trees/b38bf81b5ee5f00cf379c215a95e74dde5a11798"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssamu04/txm-mattermost/git/commits/9d1aeedf12cd639e2e932d24547ab957e504000d","verification":{"payload":"tree b38bf81b5ee5f00cf379c215a95e74dde5a11798\nparent 68bf6f80995438de44d382319bd537daaf048cd1\nauthor Alejandro García Montoro <alejandro.garciamontoro@gmail.com> 1789738813 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789738813 +0000\n\nMM-70629: Emit any instead of interface{} in generated mocks (#38475)\n\n* Replace golang/mock with go.uber.org/mock\n\ngolang/mock is unmaintained and generates mocks using\ninterface{}. Switch mmctl''s mockgen and mockery''s einterfaces\nconfig to the actively maintained go.uber.org/mock fork so\nfuture-generated mocks use any instead.\n\n* Regenerate mocks with go.uber.org/mock\n\nReflect the mockgen/mockery switch in the generated output.\n\n* Remove the rest of uses of golang/mock\n\n* make generated\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mattermost Build <build@mattermost.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrT89CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAodYQACNyS1SVjNxsxyXT9I312Rmi\nv+kyctBNq+45gV5GkKFqCLlO/wEj+ASoJxomtJJTh2LFrZLwXUbgLNEIMHXMMg7w\neq85MRZYrgOHU9PbHRQqOQ5Hg1ihrBUgwTvmLOwLk+qcRQCjra0d+gusM5nLHf2w\n17D3Z5UVpoLG4sFR6CgQa6g1CZz5pdZPb4WNS9vTlqvqnppZSy/BXS4HkNB4T/Ez\n9KviLSxOSDTaEzRmkmVfgdPhLCpByt8Z29o16Gw4LK9RdbAMFTg/zYV9Al2YCFxe\nW86Tgh3Ru+/EQVAI0BMGMwYJkKuWyVVfLmWB6TbgBNTDFmeCEtKVBbOz0K4lUV02\nxmfyy9mnWdyemk1WaCQUq0ZEyHQo04tATnd92lqTZV4ODGk/B2pO79Fm1DpQgYcG\nXr6Zl2Kt/zLdJQVPooHt2bk3wgB2zt4fg4KT/89+R1ImPupIWndxuyF3tltdpsHh\nTYNQeRpHCM5j2fTaen0GOtjlL4uoQOo6vt/M2ak3WgEE+wCzQQV834+S3yi9B1Nh\n5dgbOQSc63CTNTsOZFHcgeSatfdsxOvLNLkxt75RdtB4UCWCW8L+nMarF31bX82x\nWowEoPdEq3X4LGAByOO5kiNxZ0kBq2NBuCMJarkGBZJqAVhp/HvfLBpCWJoe3QVS\nFkOz/r2ZpSVUxFazis5w\n=KH30\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T10:05:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url