r_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/commits/bfa01cf42ff1be586fa017a931a6f87f3bafa86f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:57:28Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T18:11:41Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"message":"fix(panel): keep the steps summary height\n\nA path commit in another unit empties the step limits, which drops \"It\nclears only ...\" from the summary under the steps and turns the limits\ninto \"...\". The summary lost a line between mousedown and mouseup, and\nevery control below it moved under the pointer (18 px for the history\nspan buttons in the template editor at 390 px wide).\n\nStepFields now measures the summary after every render in which no\nstep error is withheld, and holds that height as its min-height while\nany is, reusing the withheld-until-Save flag of the emptied limits''\nerrors. The hold is set in the render that shortens the text, before\npaint, and lifts at Save, which shows those errors. Retyping the limits\ndoes not lift it, as their errors stay withheld until Save; the text\nthen fills the held space again.\n\nCloses https://github.com/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/issues/147\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fbee75a21e93740887accdf000b2a2e41dd7dd09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/git/trees/fbee75a21e93740887accdf000b2a2e41dd7dd09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/git/commits/bfa01cf42ff1be586fa017a931a6f87f3bafa86f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/407010?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/followers","following_url":"https://api.