. Pin that a field''s slope rule asks for last values and\ngives no verdict.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LikPupcD67CgrvrGKkckB8","tree":{"sha":"bc1fc0998997a7d68a8695e7df2840d3648fa6bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/git/trees/bc1fc0998997a7d68a8695e7df2840d3648fa6bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/git/commits/6eb2e724ebf2620c2c8be284b77823d245b98cdb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/407010?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mairas","id":407010,"login":"mairas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzAxMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/commit/6eb2e724ebf2620c2c8be284b77823d245b98cdb","node_id":"C_kwDOUyXQ1NoAKDZlYjJlNzI0ZWJmMjYyMGMyYzhiZTI4NGI3NzgyM2QyNDViOThjZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/commit/f2d67c4a96e48bc069927c4566c821dae2e540f0","sha":"f2d67c4a96e48bc069927c4566c821dae2e540f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/commits/f2d67c4a96e48bc069927c4566c821dae2e540f0"}],"sha":"6eb2e724ebf2620c2c8be284b77823d245b98cdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/commits/6eb2e724ebf2620c2c8be284b77823d245b98cdb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/407010?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mairas","id":407010,"login":"mairas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzAxMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/commits/f2d67c4a96e48bc069927c4566c821dae2e540f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:47:40Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:47:40Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"message":"feat(panel): name a field''s chart after the field\n\nA field rarely has a displayName of its own, and its chart then read\nonly \"Last 24 hours\", which does not say roll is drawn. Without one, a\nfield''s chart in the rule detail takes the name the rule''s words give\nit, \"Attitude roll\"; a plain path''s chart still names its span.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LikPupcD67CgrvrGKkckB8","tree":{"sha":"052d7c9cddc9e9b4bdcbe1c2126da18cf6b20bbb","url":"https://api.github.c