ents{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mairas","id":407010,"login":"mairas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzAxMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/commits/3b81782f48cfde265a5875de96e05b23f43af764/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:33:41Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:33:41Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"message":"chore(harness): store a heel rule on a field\n\n`?rules=field` adds a heel rule on `navigation.attitude#/roll`, so the\nrule detail and editor render a field''s chart, drawn from each bucket''s\nlast value with its note. AGENTS.md lists its URLs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LikPupcD67CgrvrGKkckB8","tree":{"sha":"6e2fbf231119e55f046c4768ff575492924bcef1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/git/trees/6e2fbf231119e55f046c4768ff575492924bcef1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/git/commits/3b81782f48cfde265a5875de96e05b23f43af764","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/407010?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mairas","id":407010,"login":"mairas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzAxMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/commit/3b81782f48cfde265a5875de96e05b23f43af764","node_id":"C_kwDOUyXQ1NoAKDNiODE3ODJmNDhjZmRlMjY1YTU4NzVkZTk2ZTA1YjIzZjQzYWY3NjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/commit/50a94fcbe99c27ef695f4d416d7f5c99a58c43db","sha":"50a94fcbe99c27ef695f4d416d7f5c99a58c43db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/commits/50a94fcbe99c27ef695f4d416d7f5c99a58c43db"}],"sha":"3b81782f48cfde265a5875de96e05b23f43af764","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/commits/3b81782f48cfde265a5875de96e05b23f43af764"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/407010?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mairas","id":407010,"login":"mairas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzAxMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/commits/50a94fcbe99c27ef695f4d416d7f5c99a58c43db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:29:53Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:29:53Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"message":"feat(panel): chart a field''s last value per bucket\n\nA field''s object path takes no minimum or maximum, so a pointer rule''s\nchart in the detail and beside the editor draws each bucket''s last\nvalue. A peak between two last values may not show, so the summary no\nlonger says the rule would not have alerted, and a note under the\nchart says what the line is. A pointer that is not one gets no chart.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LikPupcD67CgrvrGKkckB8","tree":{"sha":"aefdf3665c60e32819ba7a6a2cb0e80d5a2109a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/git/trees/aefdf3665c60e32819ba7a6a2cb0e80d5a2109a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/git/commits/50a94fcbe99c27ef695f4d416d7f5c99a58c43db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/407010?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/following{/other_user}","gists_ur