ed{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/commits/35f6bc5f32f137d1b159e039c6ed11ae450e4b71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:29:24Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:29:24Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"message":"feat(panel): read a field''s history by its object\n\nThe server strips \"#\" and \"/\" from history paths, and providers record\na field under its object path, answering each bucket''s whole object.\nA query for a pointer path asks for the base path, keeps the pinned\nsource, and reads the field from each bucket; a bucket without a finite\nnumber there is a gap. Aggregates gain `last`, the one an object path\ntakes that charts a value.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LikPupcD67CgrvrGKkckB8","tree":{"sha":"40d84accfd08eb95b2d2f87668c50d3f76146c95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/git/trees/40d84accfd08eb95b2d2f87668c50d3f76146c95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/git/commits/35f6bc5f32f137d1b159e039c6ed11ae450e4b71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/407010?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mairas","id":407010,"login":"mairas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzAxMA==","organizations_u