{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mairas","id":407010,"login":"mairas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzAxMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/commits/0a3db723d597b03fb44a71bd0f965c3c4c541569/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:04:15Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:04:15Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"message":"fix(model): find a field path''s leaf by segment\n\nconditionMissing reads the leaf as defaultCondition does, so the two agree on what a field path ends in. Tests pin a wildcard just before the pointer, which counts for a wildcard gate, and a stored segment holding # being refused.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VQNUveTPQcQTLf4unyd2QS","tree":{"sha":"93c0ea264283745a527017026ce334b1bfd0bc02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/git/trees/93c0ea264283745a527017026ce334b1bfd0bc02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/git/commits/0a3db723d597b03fb44a71bd0f965c3c4c541569","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/407010?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.g