:"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/commits/1fef3b580ed1b4e30c7f8d15496e4713125bb2bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:02:36Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:02:36Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"message":"fix(templates): keep placeholders out of pointers\n\nA pick may hold / or ~, which in a field pointer would name another field, so a placeholder after # is refused for open-instance and slot templates alike. A placeholder just before # is a whole segment, as one before a dot is.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VQNUveTPQcQTLf4unyd2QS","tree":{"sha":"ca616efabcb305cf5adbcade67e898cf0c1c400f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/git/trees/ca616efabcb305cf5adbcade67e898cf0c1c400f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hatlabs/signalk-alert-rules/git/commits/1fef3b580ed1b4e30c7f8d15496e4713125bb2bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/407010?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mairas","id":407010,"login":"mairas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzAxMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/