pfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/6ed2b411d73354aa9a7f5172b9a5f59892059969/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T21:17:24Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T21:17:24Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Add a script that resets the owner tenant''s demo data\n\nRemoving hundreds of orphaned customers through MigratedAccountsRemoved\noverloaded the table: the consumption domain scans the whole table per\nevent, and 121 small events left the workers'' DLQs full. Demo data need\nno such care. The script deletes every item of the owner tenant and its\ndata volume schedule entries directly — one paced scan, batches of 25 at\n4 write units a second — then empties the app''s DLQs. Platform items,\npass tables, Cognito users and the legacy systems stay. Dry run by\ndefault.","tree":{"sha":"fc6f7162b4787531a8c6b7b1ae6e8debf8acd344","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/fc6f7162b4787531a8c6b7b1ae6e8debf8acd344"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/6ed2b41