user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/191fc7c880b1488319ee9aa18c9c77ed348f84aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:23:35Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:33:34Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Backfill the operator''s directories with customers and contracts from before phase 7\n\nSince phase 7 the cockpit''s lists read the customer and contract\ndirectories; entries of older data appear only with the customer''s next\nsign-in or the contract''s next read or change, so customers who never\ncome back were missing. scripts/backfill-directory.sh fills both once per\ntenant, as a data migration with the operator''s credentials: the\ncontract domain lists its contracts and hands out their snapshots, the\ncustomer domain adds profile and contract summaries. It reads with a\npaced scan, writes at most two items a second (the table has 5 units)\nand leaves a mark per domain, so a second run writes nothing. No event\nper contract: the migration worker records every event in the cockpit''s\ntimeline.","tree":{"sha":"b092fc553b29ef6baa2cd65be7bf960fef2878c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/b092fc553b29ef6baa2cd65be7bf960fef2878c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/191fc7c880b1488319ee9aa18c9c77ed348f84aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/