-02T17:17:26Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Point the report site to the live demo\n\nThe overview page of the published reports had no direct way to the\nrunning portal. A notice with the link now sits right below the title,\nabove the page cards.","tree":{"sha":"fd62062c520b3cbb3ad09bd9b5d44ae7b52ff03c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/fd62062c520b3cbb3ad09bd9b5d44ae7b52ff03c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/79e833e4511e76ee7a6b3541bc60dbbb1f0d6eed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/79e833e4511e76ee7a6b3541bc60dbbb1f0d6eed","node_id":"C_kwDOUydk39oAKDc5ZTgzM2U0NTExZTc2ZWU3YTZiMzU0MWJjNjBkYmJiMWYwZDZlZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/4ccc037c366ff29ac61815d05beee981050e7955","sha":"4ccc037c366ff29ac61815d05beee981050e7955","url":"https://api.gi