//api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/28296feede0f5a007ca34d263df55398b14481be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:49:51Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:49:51Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Keep the zones'' API types and allow products without a minimum term\n\nweb-auth''s declarations import openapi-fetch without depending on it, so every\nzone saw the API client as ''any'' and type errors went unnoticed; it now depends\non it, which surfaced one widened literal in the bulk route. Products may have\nno minimum term, so contracts copied from them may too.","tree":{"sha":"24d71f753d978421ecdc7a0a495860068d8ab115","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/24d71f753d978421ecdc7a0a495860068d8ab115"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/28296feede0f5a007ca34d263df55398b14481be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/28296feede0f5a007ca34d263df55398b14481be","node_id":"C_kwDOUydk39oAKDI4Mjk2ZmVlZGUwZjVhMDA3Y2EzNGQyNjNkZjU1Mzk4YjE0NDgxYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/0f241a8ca1808fee6b801c4eeb89445e537ef23b","sha":"0f241a8ca1808fee6b801c4eeb89445e537ef23b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/0f241a8ca1808fee6b801c4eeb89445e537ef23b"}],"sha":"28296feede0f5a007ca34d263df55398b14481be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/28296feede0f5a007ca34d263df55398b14481be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/0f241a8ca1808fee6b801c4eeb89445e537ef23b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:38:52Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:47:38Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Show the contract lifecycle on the overview and lead to new contracts\n\nThe contract tiles on /konto now tell a pending notice (''gekündigt zum\n...'') from an ended or withdrawn contract and mark blocked ones, so the\ncustomer sees at a glance what phase 7''s termination and withdrawal did.\nA last tile leads to the product catalogue in the contracts zone, also\nwhen there are no contracts yet.","tree":{"sha":"75873eb5b1b788408928a71d66f585c4167f78b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/75873eb5b1b788408928a71d66f585c4167f78b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/0f241a8ca1808fee6b801c4eeb89445e537ef23b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/0f241a8ca1808fee6b801c4eeb89445e537ef23b","node_id":"C_kwDOUydk39oAKDBmMjQxYThjYTE4MDhmZWU2YjgwMWM0ZWViODk0NDVlNTM3ZWYyM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/37151ad33c283bae2e2a4e0ca59598c4a429300d","sha":"37151ad33c283bae2e2a4e0ca59598c4a429300d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/37151ad33c283bae2e2a4e0ca59598c4a429300d"}],"sha":"0f241a8ca1808fee6b801c4eeb89445e537ef23b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/0f241a8ca1808fee6b801c4eeb89445e537ef23b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/37151ad33c283bae2e2a4e0ca59598c4a429300d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:38:47Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:47:38Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Let customers order products and give notice or withdraw in the contracts zone\n\nPhase 7 gives the customer the whole contract lifecycle. /vertraege/neu\nlists the active products by division with their options and prices, and\n/vertraege/neu/[productId] orders one (start date within 90 days, meter\nnumber and reading for metered divisions, explicit consent) through a new\nroute handler for POST /contracts. The contract page gains a termination\ncard that states the rule and the earliest date, asks for confirmation and\nlets the customer take the notice back, and a withdrawal card while the\n14 days run. Blocked contracts say so and offer no action, matching the\nAPI''s 409. The list shows ''gekündigt zum ...'', ''beendet'', ''widerrufen''\nand ''gesperrt''.\n\nThe change form now names and prices the options from the contract''s\nproduct. Pages use a typed API client, because web-auth''s declarations\nlose the openapi-fetch types when seen from a zone.","tree":{"sha":"83ad53dfa35234d61f7f0d60c06dc2fdddcb9a22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/83ad53dfa35234d61f7f0d60c06dc2fdddcb9a22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/37151ad33c283bae2e2a4e0ca59598c4a429300d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/37151ad33c283bae2e2a4e0ca59598c4a429300d","node_id":"C_kwDOUydk39oAKDM3MTUxYWQzM2MyODNiYWUyZTJhNGUwY2E1OTU5OGM0YTQyOTMwMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/d25da590c1bbff6962b630c1677afa2b6fbafe17","sha":"d25da590c1bbff6962b630c1677afa2b6fbafe17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/d25da590c1bbff6962b630c1677afa2b6fbafe17"}],"sha":"37151ad33c283bae2e2a4e0ca59598c4a429300d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/37151ad33c283bae2e2a4e0ca59598c4a429300d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/d25da590c1bbff6962b630c1677afa2b6fbafe17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:46:14Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:47:38Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Keep the overview''s bars aligned and say \"1 Monat\"\n\nThe screenshot run showed the division bars ending at different places\n(the value column followed its text), the migration rings too small for\ntheir percentage and \"1 Monate\" for a one-month notice period.","tree":{"sha":"3dc56f4d4e9594bd5f184589c860fdb50426a05a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/3dc56f4d4e9594bd5f184589c860fdb50426a05a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/d25da590c1bbff6962b630c1677afa2b6fbafe17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/d25da590c1bbff6962b630c1677afa2b6fbafe17","node_id":"C_kwDOUydk39oAKGQyNWRhNTkwYzFiYmZmNjk2MmI2MzBjMTY3N2FmYTJiNmZiYWZlMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/8906936be4f16bdbd6a697cb6beb3c05011c2130","sha":"8906936be4f16bdbd6a697cb6beb3c05011c2130","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/8906936be4f16bdbd6a697cb6beb3c05011c2130"}],"sha":"d25da590c1bbff6962b630c1677afa2b6fbafe17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/d25da590c1bbff6962b630c1677afa2b6fbafe17"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/8906936be4f16bdbd6a697cb6beb3c05011c2130/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:41:03Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:47:38Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Turn the cockpit into the operator''s back office\n\nThe cockpit served the migration only, while the operator needs to see\ncustomers and contracts in filtered lists, control contracts and manage the\nproduct catalogue. The sidebar now starts with \"Betrieb\" (overview,\ncustomers, contracts, products, shortcuts g c/k/v/t), followed by the\nmigration, which moves unchanged to /cockpit/migration (g m) so /cockpit can\nopen on the operator''s overview of customers, contracts, orders, notices and\nthe migration status.\n\nLists are GET forms, so the URL keeps search, filters, order and the cursor\npage and works without JavaScript. Contract actions, products, status moves\nand price versions are written through new route handlers that check origin,\nsession and body like the existing ones; every contract action needs a\nreason, and terminating or blocking asks a second time. The pages code\nagainst the fixed admin contract; a 403 shows the no-access notice, a failing\nsection only its own notice.","tree":{"sha":"4600b5bea7576ab89a2ed677204509a225f00168","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/4600b5bea7576ab89a2ed677204509a225f00168"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/8906936be4f16bdbd6a697cb6beb3c05011c2130","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/8906936be4f16bdbd6a697cb6beb3c05011c2130","node_id":"C_kwDOUydk39oAKDg5MDY5MzZiZTRmMTZiZGJkNmE2OTdjYjZiZWIzYzA1MDExYzIxMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/fbff193fbcaafa1be01decbce2075eb0170b8a08","sha":"fbff193fbcaafa1be01decbce2075eb0170b8a08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/fbff193fbcaafa1be01decbce2075eb0170b8a08"}],"sha":"8906936be4f16bdbd6a697cb6beb3c05011c2130","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/8906936be4f16bdbd6a697cb6beb3c05011c2130"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/fbff193fbcaafa1be01decbce2075eb0170b8a08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:40:04Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:47:38Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Let customers order and end contracts and give the operator a back office\n\nPhase 7 needs contracts that follow a managed product catalogue and a\nlifecycle up to the termination, and an operator who sees and controls them.\nThe contract domain now keeps a product catalogue per tenant (the former demo\ntariffs become the default products, seeded on first read, with price\nversions that running contracts keep until the operator applies a new one),\nlets customers conclude contracts, give and take back notice by the rules of\nminimum term and notice period, and withdraw within 14 days, and offers the\noperator''s overview, contract list, history and controls.\n\nEvery contract save writes the contract, its entry in the tenant''s contract\ndirectory and a history entry in one transaction, so the operator''s lists\nread one partition without scans or an index and never show a change that did\nnot happen. Status follows from the termination date on every read, so no job\nhas to end contracts. Contracts saved before phase 7 count as the default\nproduct''s first version and join the directory when the customer next reads\nthem. The demo reset removes history and directory entries with the\ncontracts. Dates are German calendar dates throughout.","tree":{"sha":"206ab3cf33963a5395c99d43115c536418393518","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/206ab3cf33963a5395c99d43115c536418393518"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/fbff193fbcaafa1be01decbce2075eb0170b8a08","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/fbff193fbcaafa1be01decbce2075eb0170b8a08","node_id":"C_kwDOUydk39oAKGZiZmYxOTNmYmNhYWZhMWJlMDFkZWNiY2UyMDc1ZWIwMTcwYjhhMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/69905403ae91bb15d136050ab40fb3c1f4d08b34","sha":"69905403ae91bb15d136050ab40fb3c1f4d08b34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/69905403ae91bb15d136050ab40fb3c1f4d08b34"}],"sha":"fbff193fbcaafa1be01decbce2075eb0170b8a08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/fbff193fbcaafa1be01decbce2075eb0170b8a08"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/69905403ae91bb15d136050ab40fb3c1f4d08b34/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:32:12Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:37:25Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Show the operator a contract''s readings and follow contract ends in consumption\n\nThe cockpit''s contract detail shows the meter readings of any contract of the\noperator''s tenant (404 for contracts the tenant does not have). Contracts can\nnow end in the portal: the projection keeps the start date and a pending or\neffective termination or withdrawal. A withdrawn or terminated contract takes\nno more readings, one with a termination takes readings up to its last day,\nso the final reading can still be entered afterwards. The daily data volume\ncheck starts on a contract''s first day (orders may start later) and drops a\ncontract once its last day has passed, because no event marks that day. A\ncontract ordered by the customer gets its projection and start reading like\nthe demo contracts.","tree":{"sha":"8b0a84c88f3bd65301df2126df67167fbc50cb1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/8b0a84c88f3bd65301df2126df67167fbc50cb1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/69905403ae91bb15d136050ab40fb3c1f4d08b34","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/69905403ae91bb15d136050ab40fb3c1f4d08b34","node_id":"C_kwDOUydk39oAKDY5OTA1NDAzYWU5MWJiMTVkMTM2MDUwYWI0MGZiM2MxZjRkMDhiMzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/1a6106c645b3cc258f4f6a0712f4f0c651f104dd","sha":"1a6106c645b3cc258f4f6a0712f4f0c651f104dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/1a6106c645b3cc258f4f6a0712f4f0c651f104dd"}],"sha":"69905403ae91bb15d136050ab40fb3c1f4d08b34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/69905403ae91bb15d136050ab40fb3c1f4d08b34"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/1a6106c645b3cc258f4f6a0712f4f0c651f104dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:29:17Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:37:25Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Let the operator see a customer''s documents\n\nThe cockpit''s customer detail lists what the customer uploaded. The operator\nof the token''s tenant reads the document metadata, newest first, never the\nfiles or a download link. The documents domain keeps no list of customers,\nso an unknown customer is an empty list rather than a 404.","tree":{"sha":"45cff5ceb3033576774f69a2d536ab2f32e7e4ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/45cff5ceb3033576774f69a2d536ab2f32e7e4ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/1a6106c645b3cc258f4f6a0712f4f0c651f104dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/1a6106c645b3cc258f4f6a0712f4f0c651f104dd","node_id":"C_kwDOUydk39oAKDFhNjEwNmM2NDViM2NjMjU4ZjRmNmEwNzEyZjRmMGM2NTFmMTA0ZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/6dd26d970419246f1d8c71c5fb28f2353483aa16","sha":"6dd26d970419246f1d8c71c5fb28f2353483aa16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/6dd26d970419246f1d8c71c5fb28f2353483aa16"}],"sha":"1a6106c645b3cc258f4f6a0712f4f0c651f104dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/1a6106c645b3cc258f4f6a0712f4f0c651f104dd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/6dd26d970419246f1d8c71c5fb28f2353483aa16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:28:35Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:37:25Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Tell customers in their mailbox about orders, terminations and the operator''s steps\n\nPhase 7 lets customers order, terminate and withdraw contracts and lets the\noperator control them; every such step has to reach the customer''s mailbox,\nthe operator''s with the reason given. ContractChanged now yields one entry\nper event in German or English: a confirmation for an order (with start and\nwithdrawal deadline), for the customer''s own termination, cancellation and\nwithdrawal, and a message named after the most important of the operator''s\nchanges, followed by a sentence per change and the reason. The operator''s\ntermination and block are warnings. Contracts the system creates still get\nno entry, and the customer''s own installment and option changes keep their\ntext. The operator can also read a customer''s mailbox, read only.","tree":{"sha":"e61dbb8c95a6919cd7b126b383497cda5b10c83f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/e61dbb8c95a6919cd7b126b383497cda5b10c83f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/6dd26d970419246f1d8c71c5fb28f2353483aa16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/6dd26d970419246f1d8c71c5fb28f2353483aa16","node_id":"C_kwDOUydk39oAKDZkZDI2ZDk3MDQxOTI0NmYxZDhjNzFjNWZiMjhmMjM1MzQ4M2FhMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/6450a5f8d89f3505a5178b4cda65068b5a3988f7","sha":"6450a5f8d89f3505a5178b4cda65068b5a3988f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/6450a5f8d89f3505a5178b4cda65068b5a3988f7"}],"sha":"6dd26d970419246f1d8c71c5fb28f2353483aa16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/6dd26d970419246f1d8c71c5fb28f2353483aa16"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/6450a5f8d89f3505a5178b4cda65068b5a3988f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:24:59Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:37:25Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Give the operator a customer directory with search, filters and pages\n\nThe back office has to list a tenant''s customers with their contract state\nwithout scanning the table. The customer domain now keeps one directory\npartition per tenant: a profile summary per customer, written wherever the\nprofile is created or changed (counted by a revision so an older write never\nwins), and a small summary per contract from ContractChanged (kept by contract\nversion, so out-of-order events and events before the profile are fine).\nGET /admin/customers reads that partition once and filters, sorts and pages\nin memory with a keyset cursor; GET /admin/customers/{id} reads the profile\nand its contract summaries. Both are for the operator of the token''s tenant\nonly. Profiles from before phase 7 join the directory on their next read;\nthe demo reset removes the directory entries with the profile.","tree":{"sha":"d0122aeb83b9324453ad9e694b824ff7f0a5b4a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/d0122aeb83b9324453ad9e694b824ff7f0a5b4a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/6450a5f8d89f3505a5178b4cda65068b5a3988f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/6450a5f8d89f3505a5178b4cda65068b5a3988f7","node_id":"C_kwDOUydk39oAKDY0NTBhNWY4ZDg5ZjM1MDVhNTE3OGI0Y2RhNjUwNjhiNWEzOTg4Zjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/38abb2ae32e1e1dfe34f4ba8aeac02c1dd3699cf","sha":"38abb2ae32e1e1dfe34f4ba8aeac02c1dd3699cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/38abb2ae32e1e1dfe34f4ba8aeac02c1dd3699cf"}],"sha":"6450a5f8d89f3505a5178b4cda65068b5a3988f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/6450a5f8d89f3505a5178b4cda65068b5a3988f7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/38abb2ae32e1e1dfe34f4ba8aeac02c1dd3699cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:17:07Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:17:07Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Describe the operator, the product catalogue and the contract lifecycle\n\nThe concept knew only customers, pass holders and a migration cockpit. Phase 7\nmakes the cockpit the operator''s back office; the concept now names the\noperator role, the product model with price versions, the lifecycle rules the\nowner decided (order, withdrawal, termination, operator controls) and the new\njourneys J10 to J12.","tree":{"sha":"b194e68ee23c1e8af40903e48665c13a33e68c7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/b194e68ee23c1e8af40903e48665c13a33e68c7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/38abb2ae32e1e1dfe34f4ba8aeac02c1dd3699cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/38abb2ae32e1e1dfe34f4ba8aeac02c1dd3699cf","node_id":"C_kwDOUydk39oAKDM4YWJiMmFlMzJlMWUxZGZlMzRmNGJhOGFlYWMwMmMxZGQzNjk5Y2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/69d320373c5c7830cce61c4f3ec0d73a3ec10e5f","sha":"69d320373c5c7830cce61c4f3ec0d73a3ec10e5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/69d320373c5c7830cce61c4f3ec0d73a3ec10e5f"}],"sha":"38abb2ae32e1e1dfe34f4ba8aeac02c1dd3699cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/38abb2ae32e1e1dfe34f4ba8aeac02c1dd3699cf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/69d320373c5c7830cce61c4f3ec0d73a3ec10e5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:14:08Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:14:08Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Fix the contract for phase 7: operator back office, products and contract lifecycle\n\nThe cockpit served the migration only; the operator needs customers and\ncontracts in filtered lists, control over contracts and a product catalogue,\nand customers need to order products and end contracts. The contract adds the\noperator''s operations behind new admin scopes, ordering, termination and\nwithdrawal for customers, and a product catalogue with price versions. The\nlifecycle travels as ContractChanged with new change kinds and who initiated\nit, so projections, mailbox and timeline follow without new routes; the\ncustomer directory gets ContractChanged for its contract summary. The operator\ncheck moves to service-kit for every service to share.","tree":{"sha":"d914aeca05a6706c86591e4fdca1ec403d492aed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/d914aeca05a6706c86591e4fdca1ec403d492aed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/69d320373c5c7830cce61c4f3ec0d73a3ec10e5f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https