4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T13:43:11Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T13:43:24Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Show the phase 6 building blocks in Storybook with the mockup''s data\n\nThree story groups (Charts, Dashboard, Navigation) render every new block\nwith the German demo data of the mockup, plus two composed pages, the\ncockpit''s key figures and the consumption page, so presets, dark mode and\nphone width can be judged before the zones use them.","tree":{"sha":"62b3be7380d1cf0407c7dab8ed2d3d1de799ec05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/62b3be7380d1cf0407c7dab8ed2d3d1de799ec05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/981cd88b25685e2686d2552a4b3cd540feb1394c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/981cd88b25685e2686d2552a4b3cd540feb1394c","node_id":"C_kwDOUydk39oAKDk4MWNkODhiMjU2ODVlMjY4NmQyNTUyYTRiM2NkNTQwZmViMTM5NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/40413792a9941b2947949983842d16e019ed49f0","sha":"40413792a9941b2947949983842d16e019ed49f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/40413792a9941b2947949983842d16e019ed49f0"}],"sha":"981cd88b25685e2686d2552a4b3cd540feb1394c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/981cd88b25685e2686d2552a4b3cd540feb1394c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/40413792a9941b2947949983842d16e019ed49f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T13:43:11Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T13:43:24Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Test the new building blocks and the contrast they rely on\n\nCovers the roles and names screen readers get (ring, meters, tabs, switch,\nsearch landmark, unread messages, nav counters), the keyboard behaviour\n(arrow keys in tabs, \"g c\" that stays quiet while typing, \"/\" to search),\nthe demo-value marker''s attributes and texts in both languages, the bar\nchart''s table and estimated months, sparklines without NaN for empty or\nflat series, and that sections and sub entries only appear in the sidebar.\n\nStatus badges and the demo-value marker put status text on its own tinted\nbackground, previews sit on the unread tint and bottom-bar counters on the\naccent; those pairs join the WCAG check for every preset in both modes.\nThe design page records the new pair count and the stylesheet parts.","tree":{"sha":"1907d33cd29d2a9896a5ec5eaeaa9a8898381086","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/1907d33cd29d2a9896a5ec5eaeaa9a8898381086"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/40413792a9941b2947949983842d16e019ed49f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/40413792a9941b2947949983842d16e019ed49f0","node_id":"C_kwDOUydk39oAKDQwNDEzNzkyYTk5NDFiMjk0Nzk0OTk4Mzg0MmQxNmUwMTllZDQ5ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/f9545e84a61d8bbb7a686e102e0910067b72de30","sha":"f9545e84a61d8bbb7a686e102e0910067b72de30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/f9545e84a61d8bbb7a686e102e0910067b72de30"}],"sha":"40413792a9941b2947949983842d16e019ed49f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/40413792a9941b2947949983842d16e019ed49f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/f9545e84a61d8bbb7a686e102e0910067b72de30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T13:43:03Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T13:43:24Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Add the mockup''s building blocks to the component library\n\nPhase 6 makes the portal pages look like docs/design/mockups.html. The pages\nare composed in the zones, so the pieces they share live in packages/ui:\nthe icon set (inline SVG, no sprite, so server-rendered pages need no global\ndefinitions), status badge, the uniform \"Demo-Wert\" marker for simulated\nvalues, live indicator, keys, banner, key figure tiles, progress ring,\nsparkline, monthly bar chart with comparison line, estimated months and a\ntable, mini quota bars, timeline, message list, search field with \"/\",\nkey sequences such as \"g c\", accessible tabs, a switch and thin layout\nhelpers.\n\nCard, Page, Meter and the app shell gain what the mockup shows (card\nactions and danger tone, eyebrow and aside, thin meter, nav icons, counters,\nsidebar sections and shortcut hints, brand mark, version chip, search slot)\nas optional props, so existing call sites render as before. The sidebar\ngets its own list only when entries need it; top and bottom bar keep the\nplain entries.\n\nThe stylesheet grew past the repository''s 500-line limit, so it is split by\ntopic; the build concatenates the parts into the same dist/styles.css.","tree":{"sha":"976a55dae8781562a411c13a7d1eacfd5a36125d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/976a55dae8781562a411c13a7d1eacfd5a36125d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/f9545e84a61d8bbb7a686e102e0910067b72de30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","n