nts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/84c3baeeada123a9716f572ee221b4c277460993/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:30:05Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:30:05Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Render the visitor''s theme in the shell and every zone without a flash\n\nPages rendered per request (zones, account, mailbox, pass) read the theme\ncookies in their root layout and put the attributes on <html> from the\nfirst byte. The prerendered shell pages (start page, redeem page, 404)\ncannot read cookies, so they ship the customer default and load\n/theme-init.js synchronously in <head>; it applies the validated cookies\nbefore the body is painted.\n\nThe script is a route handler of the shell, prerendered at build time,\nbecause the Lambda''s standalone build carries no public/ folder and the\nedge already routes unmatched paths to the shell. As an external\nsame-origin file it needs no new CSP hash; the proxy skips it. The\ncockpit zone declares the cockpit audience, so its default is \"Dicht\".","tree":{"sha":"10dd3e0146582ce2455344a125c7ffb2c94376df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/10dd3e0146582ce2455344a125c7ffb2c94376df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/84c3baeeada123a9716f572ee221b4c277460993","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/84c3baeeada123a9716f572ee221b4c277460993","node_id":"C_kwDOUydk39oAKDg0YzNiYWVlYWRhMTIzYTk3MTZmNTcyZWUyMjFiNGMyNzc0NjA5OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/ae70583eeaae75d34121eda77734d8fdee15c21c","sha":"ae70583eeaae75d34121eda77734d8fdee15c21c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/ae70583eeaae75d34121eda77734d8fdee15c21c"}],"sha":"84c3baeeada123a9716f572ee221b4c277460993","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/84c3baeeada123a9716f572ee221b4c277460993"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/ae70583eeaae75d34121eda77734d8fdee15c21c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:29:56Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:29:56Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Add switchable theme presets to the UI library\n\nThe owner chose \"Klar\" for customers and \"Dicht\" for the cockpit as\ndefaults, switchable in the user menu. All seven presets of the design\nmockup are now token sets computed from one source (themes.ts) with the\nmockup''s formulas; the build writes them into dist/styles.css, so pages\npick a theme only through attributes on <html> (audience, preset, colour\nmode) and the component CSS reads every value from --kp-* tokens.\n\nThe navigation placement (top bar, sidebar, bottom bar on phones) and\nthe current-entry marker follow the preset in CSS on the same AppShell\nmarkup, so focus order and landmarks stay identical. The user menu gets\na \"Darstellung\" section with menuitemradio entries; signed-out visitors\nget the same as a small menu button. Choices apply at once and persist\nin validated, site-wide cookies.\n\nA unit test computes the WCAG contrast of 25 token pairs for every\npreset in light and dark; it caught the mockup''s link colour falling to\n3.6:1 on the tinted nav entry in dark mode, now fitted to 4.5:1.\nStorybook gets preset and mode toolbar globals instead of the themes\naddon.","tree":{"sha":"791c81ed5ca2d21d31454b7fa26aa7abb8b318c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/791c81ed5ca2d21d31454b7fa26aa7abb8b318c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/ae70583eeaae75d34121eda77734d8fdee15c21c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}}