tps://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/9e3571c33dd6b3a2dc46a6327e25582a43c7f154/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T06:34:13Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T06:34:50Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Document the 48-hour pass, the restart at the first sign-in and the reminder\n\nThe owner decided on 01.10.2026 that a demo pass lasts 48 hours instead\nof seven days, restarted once by the holder''s first sign-in, and that a\nholder who has not signed in after 24 hours gets the invitation once\nmore. The tenancy architecture describes activation, the moved expiry\nschedule, the reminder schedule and its at-most-once claim; the demo\npass page keeps the earlier seven-day requirement as history. Overview,\nconcept and glossary follow; the reports are regenerated.","tree":{"sha":"f9cc860ec7bd38b6199fa2de203cba1693cc2845","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/f9cc860ec7bd38b6199fa2de203cba1693cc2845"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/9e3571c33dd6b3a2dc46a6327e25582a43c7f154","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/9e3571c33dd6b3a2dc46a6327e25582a43c7f154","node_id":"C_kwDOUydk39oAKDllMzU3MWMzM2RkNmIzYTJkYzQ2YTYzMjdlMjU1ODJhNDNjN2YxNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/3e290ba08ce6f2983fc9c8e2b769505a71d6a172","sha":"3e290ba08ce6f2983fc9c8e2b769505a71d6a172","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/3e290ba08ce6f2983fc9c8e2b769505a71d6a172"}],"sha":"9e3571c33dd6b3a2dc46a6327e25582a43c7f154","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/9e3571c33dd6b3a2dc46a6327e25582a43c7f154"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/3e290ba08ce6f2983fc9c8e2b769505a71d6a172/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T06:32:39Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T06:34:50Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Offer passes in hours and activate them from the portal''s sign-in\n\nThe contract''s PassOffer carries passHours instead of passDays, and the\nnew operation activateOwnPass (POST /tenancy/pass/activate, scope\ntenancy.read) lets the portal start a holder''s 48 hours at the first\nsign-in. The API stack routes it to the tenancy API function; without\nthat mapping the stack refuses to synthesize.\n\nThe shell calls the activation after writing the session of a pass\nholder, waits at most two seconds and only logs failures, so a sign-in\nnever fails over it. Redeem page, start page and cockpit now speak of 48\nhours from the first sign-in instead of seven days.","tree":{"sha":"93dfd37d99d0687d462553960e1a8d3eada337bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/93dfd37d99d0687d462553960e1a8d3eada337bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/3e290ba08ce6f2983fc9c8e2b769505a71d6a172","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/3e290ba08ce6f2983fc9c8e2b769505a71d6a172","node_id":"C_kwDOUydk39oAKDNlMjkwYmEwOGNlNmYyOTgzZmM5YzhlMmI3Njk1MDVhNzFkNmExNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/731d831f694d537116cd14cca03e81398c2637a2","sha":"731d831f694d537116cd14cca03e81398c2637a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/731d831f694d537116cd14cca03e81398c2637a2"}],"sha":"3e290ba08ce6f2983fc9c8e2b769505a71d6a172","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/3e290ba08ce6f2983fc9c8e2b769505a71d6a172"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/731d831f694d537116cd14cca03e81398c2637a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T06:32:31Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T06:34:50Z","email":"jan.pfeil@rypox.net","name":"Jan Pfeil"},"message":"Run demo passes for 48 hours, restart them at the first sign-in and remind idle holders\n\nA pass now lasts PASS_HOURS (default 48) instead of seven days. The first\nsign-in of the holder (POST /tenancy/pass/activate) records activatedAt and\nmoves the end to 48 hours from then, so a holder who redeems late in the\nevening still gets the full time. Short test passes keep their minutes.\n\nThe activation only updates tenant and pass in one transaction; the API\nneeds no scheduler rights. When the original expiry schedule fires before\nthe new end, the worker creates a second schedule (pass-expiry-moved-*)\nat the new end instead of ending the pass.\n\nHolders who received Cognito''s invitation and have not signed in after\nREMINDER_HOURS (default 24) get it again: a one-time reminder schedule\ncalls the worker, which resends the invitation (AdminCreateUser RESEND)\nwhile the account is still FORCE_CHANGE_PASSWORD. reminderSentAt is\nclaimed conditionally so it goes out at most once, and released if\nCognito fails. The daily reconcile sends a reminder that no schedule\nsent, for example while the stack was paused. Teardown removes every\nschedule of the tenant. The public offer reports passHours.","tree":{"sha":"7020ee19e0c4f27d13b67a6c075391191f670313","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/trees/7020ee19e0c4f27d13b67a6c075391191f670313"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/git/commits/731d831f694d537116cd14cca03e81398c2637a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil","id":5345175,"login":"janpfeil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDUxNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/731d831f694d537116cd14cca03e81398c2637a2","node_id":"C_kwDOUydk39oAKDczMWQ4MzFmNjk0ZDUzNzExNmNkMTRjY2EwM2U4MTM5OGMyNjM3YTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commit/63094b406b924d71dec0250e173487f3df943c31","sha":"63094b406b924d71dec0250e173487f3df943c31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/63094b406b924d71dec0250e173487f3df943c31"}],"sha":"731d831f694d537116cd14cca03e81398c2637a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janpfeil/kundenportal-demo/commits/731d831f694d537116cd14cca03e81398c2637a2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5345175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janpfeil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"http