dth findings list while demo-showcase and the e2e specs already describe the tabs. Reconcile the spec with what page.ts renders: the two tabs, the selected-app findings panel sharing the badge''s error+warning scope, and the Doctor row click that jumps to Apps.","tree":{"sha":"549dfb62a61aa00b04d3c4aceb68cd888d89525d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gedu/repack-atlas/git/trees/549dfb62a61aa00b04d3c4aceb68cd888d89525d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gedu/repack-atlas/git/commits/d147683ffdecf82ba6c795bc88d85a976a04b731","verification":{"payload":"tree 549dfb62a61aa00b04d3c4aceb68cd888d89525d\nparent c7ed8322906a2ce3757df5409b5daddd9f7da2da\nauthor edug <gedu@users.noreply.github.com> 1791292907 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791292907 +0200\n\nfeat(doctor): cut doctor and Studio findings noise (#68)\n\n* fix(core): report the conventional eager mismatch as info not warning\n\n* test(fixtures): add fixture-eager-advisory provoking the info-severity eager advisory\n\n* feat(cli): collapse repeated doctor findings and hide infos by default\n\n* feat(studio): filter doctor findings by severity and collapse repeated codes\n\n* docs: document the info-severity eager advisory and the new doctor filters\n\n* docs(odd): track the doctor signal-to-noise feature tasks\n\n* feat(studio): split Apps and Doctor views and scope findings panel to selection\n\n* docs(prd): describe the Studio Apps and Doctor tabs in the layout spec\n\nThe PRD studio layout still described the pre-tab full-width findings list while demo-showcase and the e2e specs already describe the tabs. Reconcile the spec with what page.ts renders: the two tabs, the selected-app findings panel sharing the badge''s error+warning scope, and the Doctor row click that jumps to Apps.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxPXrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOJwQAA+FzfNSMkWp1KLT1xTCWhy4\n5z3uHM78rXMNIeShxuUbdeTgcT2FjYJlCd43mpGssYSCVx3jHCQeOmFlAGogwPFf\nA9LJjCXvs9NXyjiwzGs