ser_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gedu/repack-atlas/commits/f9053ae762d89ef8ed179d4326ceed45eff96fa0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T20:17:15Z","email":"eduardo.graciano@callstack.com","name":"Edu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T20:17:15Z","email":"eduardo.graciano@callstack.com","name":"Edu"},"message":"feat(dev): launch the app on the device once the target is ready\n\nAdd --launch, --no-launch and --device: a one-shot run-<platform> --no-packager from the target''s own react-native CLI (standalone remote, else host), spawned once on the target''s first ready, [launch]-prefixed and killed on shutdown. A failed launch is reported (stderr, {event:''launch''}) and never changes the exit code. Dry-run shows the launch without spawning it.\n\nAlso stop inheriting stray ATLAS_APP_* env values, guard throwing port probes and CLI resolvers, and share the app selection rule.","tree":{"sha":"42831c9cbf6b5c42a22ca20922837b1700a1e86c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gedu/repack-atlas/git/trees/42831c9cbf6b5c42a22ca20922837b1700a1e86c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gedu/repack-atlas/git/commits/f9053ae762d89ef8ed179d4326ceed45eff96fa0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1676818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gedu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gedu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gedu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gedu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gedu","id":1676818,"login":"gedu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzY4MTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gedu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gedu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gedu/repos","site_admin":fal