T18:54:27Z","email":"eduardo.graciano@callstack.com","name":"Edu"},"message":"docs: record the manifest plugin as Atlas-owned\n\nRe.Pack will never merge feat/federation-manifest (PR #1463), so there is\nno vendor-to-export swap. Record the owner decision (2026-09-30) in PRD R2,\nrewrite 6.2 and 8.2 for the Atlas-owned fork, and drop the swap condition\nand procedure from VENDORED.md, the bridge skill, AGENTS.md and code\ncomments. Provenance and MIT headers stay. State that repack-atlas/plugin\nand repack-atlas/introspection are Atlas public API and that Re.Pack / MF\ncompatibility is validated by Atlas. Docs and comments only.\n\nCloses #32","tree":{"sha":"6bd74b2d0e1c4bf58d473afdbd7ffdb72099c6de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gedu/repack-atlas/git/trees/6bd74b2d0e1c4bf58d473afdbd7ffdb72099c6de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gedu/repack-atlas/git/commits/597951d9cb923aedac01cf6345a0272fe6b01c84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1676818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gedu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gedu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gedu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gedu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gedu","id":1676818,"login":"gedu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzY4MTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gedu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gedu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gedu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gedu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gedu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gedu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gedu/repack-atlas/commit/597951d9cb923aedac