"email":"58499760+bobo541574@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bo Bo"},"message":"Initial commit: Laravel 13 + Vue 3 multi-tenant documentation engine\n\nBackend (backend/):\n- Laravel 13 skeleton: bootstrap/app.php (middleware aliases tenant/api.key/\n  api.rate, scheduler via ->withSchedule()), core config, storage tree\n- Multi-tenancy bound to request lifecycle via TenantAwareTrait global scope\n  + creating hook, resolving app(''tenant'') set by TenantMiddleware\n- Ingestion pipeline: POST /api/v1/ingest/{project_slug} returns 202 + queue_id,\n  Redis SET NX EX idempotency on X-Sync-Id, ProcessIngestJob transactional\n- Service layer for domain logic; queue jobs across default/ingestion/\n  attachments/webhooks/ai\n- 14 migrations incl. range partitioning (incoming_data_queue, activity_logs),\n  GIN tsvector + trigger on documents, and partitions:create command\n- API keys SHA-256 hashed, Redis ZSET sliding-window rate limiting\n- Pest test suite under tests/\n\nFrontend (backend/resources):\n- Vue 3 + Vite + Tailwind SPA, host layout app.blade.php, router with\n  @/ alias set mirrored between vite.config.ts and tsconfig.json\n- Dashboard page consuming /api/v1/dashboard/stats\n\nInfra:\n- docker-compose.yml (pgsql, redis, minio, meilisearch, horizon, nginx) plus\n  docker/{php,nginx,supervisor}\n\n.gitignore fixes:\n- backend/database/.gitignore used `*` + allowlist, which excluded the whole\n  migrations/factories/seeders tree; restored to Laravel default (*.sqlite*)\n- unignore backend/package-lock.json, required by docker/php/Dockerfile\n- ignore .DS_Store repo-wide","tree":{"sha":"ed8adb9bc3e3c230d95404535988895c345eb4f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bobo541574/lumani-doc-generator/git/trees/ed8adb9bc3e3c230d95404535988895c345eb4f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bobo541574/lumani-doc-generator/git/commits/6a3f7131ee5979a73364950daa00fb618b796133","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58499760?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobo541574/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobo541574/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobo541574/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobo541574/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bobo541574","id":58499760,"login":"bobo541574","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NDk5NzYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobo541574/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobo541574/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobo541574/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobo541574/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobo541574/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobo541574","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bobo541574/lumani-doc-generator/commit/6a3f7131ee5979a73364950daa00fb618b796133","node_id":"C_kwDOUy7NKNoAKDZhM2Y3MTMxZWU1OTc5YTczMzY0OTUwZGFhMDBmYjYxOGI3OTYxMzM","parents":[],"sha":"6a3f7131ee5979a73364950daa00fb618b796133","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bobo541574/lumani-doc-generator/commits/6a3f7131ee5979a73364950daa00fb618b796133"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/bobo541574/lumani-doc-generator/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=6a3f7131ee5979a73364950daa00fb618b796133&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A21%3A58.081Z"}');
