原生 CLI（--golden 对拍、--check、--bench）\n- 新增 boom-data/（随包资源）与 tools/export_flat_weights.py（npz → 索引 json + f32 bin）\n- 前端改为进程内 wasm（?url + initSync + load_model），去掉 run_exe / 结果文件 / token；\n  vite 补 base:''./''；device 加 android、info.json platform = windows,android\n- 新增门禁：boom-core --golden、verify-wasm.mjs、check_basis_parity.py、compare_impls.py\n- 对拍：Rust 原生 1.818e-6 / wasm 2.119e-6（阈值 1e-4，参考值为原 PyTorch 输出）；\n  宿主端到端 8/8 分子与原生一致\n- 性能：f64 标量 368ms → f32 264ms → 手写 wasm SIMD 82ms（原生 29ms）\n- Q/D/p 第二套实现 kamlet_noco：留出集 D 4.194%→2.313%、p 5.348%→4.624%\n- 删除 python-3.10/ 与 tools/prepare_python.py；包体积 48.4 → 27.9 MB\n- 大二进制（*.pt / *.npz / boom-data/*.bin）不再进版本库，与 wmvie.flavor 的约定一致","tree":{"sha":"98fdac1c78f0d4cc3a95f2d87228db2ba1ae26b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qmlCoder/wmview_boom/git/trees/98fdac1c78f0d4cc3a95f2d87228db2ba1ae26b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qmlCoder/wmview_boom/git/commits/afd8dde453db5d6f224fdbfb70df7bf1f8acbdc7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88520934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmlCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmlCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmlCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmlCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/qmlCoder","id":88520934,"login":"qmlCoder","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NTIwOTM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmlCoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmlCoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmlCoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmlCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmlCoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qmlCoder","user_view