-tryout/commits/5c70593236dd7ca9d4cd1d02848fd4d75559689a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T08:36:37Z","email":"jann.hopster@hof-university.de","name":"Jann Hopster"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T08:51:49Z","email":"jann.hopster@hof-university.de","name":"Jann Hopster"},"message":"Add neccessities for Acestep Space","tree":{"sha":"bad89e085252bd145a45038d890ba25bdc7e1f33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/git/trees/bad89e085252bd145a45038d890ba25bdc7e1f33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/git/commits/5c70593236dd7ca9d4cd1d02848fd4d75559689a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commit/5c70593236dd7ca9d4cd1d02848fd4d75559689a","node_id":"C_kwDOUzzO6NoAKDVjNzA1OTMyMzZkZDdjYTlkNGNkMWQwMjg0OGZkNGQ3NTU1OTY4OWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commit/e61396ef7552d14745dccbaa6c35872d445b2b9d","sha":"e61396ef7552d14745dccbaa6c35872d445b2b9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commits/e61396ef7552d14745dccbaa6c35872d445b2b9d"}],"sha":"5c70593236dd7ca9d4cd1d02848fd4d75559689a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commits/5c70593236dd7ca9d4cd1d02848fd4d75559689a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commits/e61396ef7552d14745dccbaa6c35872d445b2b9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T12:53:01Z","email":"jann.hopster@hof-university.de","name":"Jann Hopster"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T08:47:45Z","email":"jann.hopster@hof-university.de","name":"Jann Hopster"},"message":"Fix Admin page crash when space owner_id is an integer\n\n/admin/spaces returns owner_id as the internal integer id, but\nownerLabel() called id.slice(0, 8) assuming a string UUID — calling\n.slice on a number threw, crashing the whole AdminDashboard render\n(blank page, the user could not open /admin). Coerce to String before\nany string ops and fall back to a readable \"#<id>\" when no user matches.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c10cd06ca8710fbfdc67a9d4a2cf63869138ddf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/git/trees/9c10cd06ca8710fbfdc67a9d4a2cf63869138ddf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/git/commits/e61396ef7552d14745dccbaa6c35872d445b2b9d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commit/e61396ef7552d14745dccbaa6c35872d445b2b9d","node_id":"C_kwDOUzzO6NoAKGU2MTM5NmVmNzU1MmQxNDc0NWRjY2JhYTZjMzU4NzJkNDQ1YjJiOWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commit/67d2ddbc423aa214890a86aed767659a86e40c39","sha":"67d2ddbc423aa214890a86aed767659a86e40c39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commits/67d2ddbc423aa214890a86aed767659a86e40c39"}],"sha":"e61396ef7552d14745dccbaa6c35872d445b2b9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commits/e61396ef7552d14745dccbaa6c35872d445b2b9d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commits/67d2ddbc423aa214890a86aed767659a86e40c39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T12:52:50Z","email":"jann.hopster@hof-university.de","name":"Jann Hopster"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T08:47:45Z","email":"jann.hopster@hof-university.de","name":"Jann Hopster"},"message":"Fix blank options in space input select dropdown\n\nSpace input `options` are stored/created as plain strings (e.g.\n[\"768\",\"512\"]), but SpaceInputField rendered {opt.value}/{opt.label},\nso every option label was undefined — the dropdown showed empty rows\n(looked like invisible text). Normalise to accept both string and\n{value,label} option shapes, and widen InputFieldConfig.options to\n(string | InputOption)[] to match the data. Also fixes the duplicate\nReact key warning (keys were all undefined).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bbde92d2de427a8bc2bd1e5ae1a467b732f93fa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/git/trees/bbde92d2de427a8bc2bd1e5ae1a467b732f93fa3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/git/commits/67d2ddbc423aa214890a86aed767659a86e40c39","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commit/67d2ddbc423aa214890a86aed767659a86e40c39","node_id":"C_kwDOUzzO6NoAKDY3ZDJkZGJjNDIzYWEyMTQ4OTBhODZhZWQ3Njc2NTlhODZlNDBjMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commit/093584ef3fd7fdb17628fb2049f8bb98763acb19","sha":"093584ef3fd7fdb17628fb2049f8bb98763acb19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commits/093584ef3fd7fdb17628fb2049f8bb98763acb19"}],"sha":"67d2ddbc423aa214890a86aed767659a86e40c39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commits/67d2ddbc423aa214890a86aed767659a86e40c39"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133755900?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah0610/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah0610/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah0610/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah0610/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarah0610","id":133755900,"login":"sarah0610","node_id":"U_kgDOB_jz_A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah0610/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah0610/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah0610/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah0610/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https: