om/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commits/b7b73ed540265ebd25223625e9cd955d5e96755d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commits/25961ba037d5f588356b42cd7bcb773a4c9eefaa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T19:08:40Z","email":"jann.hopster@hof-university.de","name":"Jann Hopster"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T19:08:40Z","email":"jann.hopster@hof-university.de","name":"Jann Hopster"},"message":"Add docstrings to job status-transition services (A1)\n\nDocument list_jobs_by_user_service, start_job_service, succeed_job_service and\nfail_job_service in the style of cancel_job_service: the status transition and\nits side effects (queue_position, finished_at, started_at backfill, error_code).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7ba85b94e265a66c1a4921300c0978e0fb48b2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/git/trees/a7ba85b94e265a66c1a4921300c0978e0fb48b2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/git/commits/25961ba037d5f588356b42cd7bcb773a4c9eefaa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commit/25961ba037d5f588356b42cd7bcb773a4c9eefaa","node_id":"C_kwDOUzzO6NoAKDI1OTYxYmEwMzdkNWY1ODgzNTZiNDJjZDdiY2I3NzNhNGM5ZWVmYWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commit/eccb53849667e300a99a869ae46bd1425576a2f5","sha":"eccb53849667e300a99a869ae46bd1425576a2f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commits/eccb53849667e300a99a869ae46bd1425576a2f5"}],"sha":"25961ba037d5f588356b42cd7bcb773a4c9eefaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commits/25961ba037d5f588356b42cd7bcb773a4c9eefaa"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commits/eccb53849667e300a99a869ae46bd1425576a2f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"