41Z","email":"jann.hopster@hof-university.de","name":"Jann Hopster"},"message":"Repair pre-existing backend test suite\n\nThe recent id/public_id refactor (id -> integer PK, public_id -> UUID) plus\nmodule renames broke the backend tests:\n- seed fixtures inserted uuid7 values into integer primary keys\n- tests addressed internal endpoints with public UUIDs (now integer id) and\n  vice versa\n- integration/conftest.py and test_fake_runner.py imported stale module paths\n  (app.config/app.db/app.models)\n- uuid.uuid7 only exists on Python 3.14 (this venv is 3.13)\n\nFixes, behaviour-preserving:\n- conftest: uuid.uuid7 fallback to uuid6 backport for py3.13; seed via ORM so\n  integer PKs autoincrement; register sqlite UUID adapter\n- seed helpers return ORM objects so tests pick .id (internal) vs .public_id\n  (external); point the removed GET /jobs?status= at /internal/jobs\n- declare the previously-undeclared uuid6 test dependency\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"751d7e903e7e6715e01431ad47f873dfef5160ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/git/trees/751d7e903e7e6715e01431ad47f873dfef5160ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/git/commits/03baa700c837217023a7e68890b987519642e38f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commit/03baa700c837217023a7e68890b987519642e38f","node_id":"C_kwDOUzzO6NoAKDAzYmFhNzAwYzgzNzIxNzAyM2E3ZTY4ODkwYjk4NzUxOTY0MmUzOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commit/bf9e16fafbf5e091e54158a40b6fbef5b17fb1a1","sha":"bf9e16fafbf5e091e54158a40b6fbef5b17fb1a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commits/bf9e16fafbf5e091e54158a40b6fbef5b17fb1a1"}],"sha":"03baa700c837217023a7e68890b987519642e38f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atilla888/ai-tryout/commits/03baa700c837217023a7e68890b98751