e to App1''s Position would silently\ndrift out of sync with the cross-app event contract. Position now\nlives in shared/src/domain/position.ts (mirroring events/ as a\nby-concern subfolder), and App1''s own files import it from there\ninstead of declaring or re-declaring it locally. App1 keeps ownership\nof the mock seed data (INITIAL_POSITIONS).","tree":{"sha":"0ea091849a4b32c9de04ce8a98e9866d9a8fd07c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kamalpatel125/ui-microfrontend/git/trees/0ea091849a4b32c9de04ce8a98e9866d9a8fd07c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kamalpatel125/ui-microfrontend/git/commits/b2df81ee7283be794f14ccfd1bcd1a986b239e7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5058102?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamalpatel125/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamalpatel125/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamalpatel125/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamalpatel125/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kamalpatel125","id":5058102,"login":"kamalpatel125","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNTgxMDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamalpatel125/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamalpatel125/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamalpatel125/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamalpatel125/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamalpatel125/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamalpatel125","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kamalpatel125/ui-microfrontend/commit/b2df81ee7283be794f14ccfd1bcd1a986b239e7d","node_id":"C_kwDOUz0Vj9oAKGIyZGY4MWVlNzI4M2JlNzk0ZjE0Y2NmZDFiY2QxYTk4NmIyMzllN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kamal