dbf12c6cec1320756dbe81f16942a7d9fb3f831"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commits/85b3b5a596236a75f7dee72d6cbfe3238947cc19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T07:17:52Z","email":"veldandiganesh9-svg","name":"Ganesh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T07:17:52Z","email":"veldandiganesh9-svg","name":"Ganesh"},"message":"master commit","tree":{"sha":"b8026b479e45a0d79add44cb49719870d080cea7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/git/trees/b8026b479e45a0d79add44cb49719870d080cea7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/git/commits/85b3b5a596236a75f7dee72d6cbfe3238947cc19","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commit/85b3b5a596236a75f7dee72d6cbfe3238947cc19","node_id":"C_kwDOU0ihtNoAKDg1YjNiNWE1OTYyMzZhNzVmN2RlZTcyZDZjYmZlMzIzODk0N2NjMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commit/31697cbf859e64cad5947e386a801651db455694","sha":"31697cbf859e64cad5947e386a801651db455694","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commits/31697cbf859e64cad5947e386a801651db455694"}],"sha":"85b3b5a596236a75f7dee72d6cbfe3238947cc19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commits/85b3b5a596236a75f7dee72d6cbfe3238947cc19"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commits/31697cbf859e64cad5947e386a801651db455694/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:05:26Z","email":"vishal.gundeti@vhrtechhub.com","name":"Gundeti Vishal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:05:26Z","email":"vishal.gundeti@vhrtechhub.com","name":"Gundeti Vishal"},"message":"Implement Tier 2: Angular dashboard\n\nStandalone components (Angular 19), signals-based state split into client/\nURL state (PolicyQueryStore) and server state (PolicyDataService), no\ncomponent framework (hand-rolled, token-driven UI).\n\nCore features: paginated/sortable/filterable policy table with free-text\nsearch, bulk flag-for-review with multi-select (select-all with correct\nindeterminate state), summary stats panel that reacts to filter changes,\nloading/empty/error states throughout.\n\nState management: filters/sort/page/selection live in PolicyQueryStore\nand one-way sync to the URL via Router.navigate, so any view is shareable\nand survives a refresh. PolicyDataService reacts to query changes via\ntoObservable + switchMap so a rapid string of filter edits only resolves\nthe latest request. Every component below the dashboard container is\npurely presentational (inputs/outputs only), which is what keeps the\ncomponent tests free of Router/HttpClient dependencies.\n\nTheming: CSS custom properties, light/dark/system with persisted\npreference (via a thin LocalStorageService abstraction), respects\nprefers-color-scheme for ''system''.\n\nAccessibility: semantic table markup, aria-sort, labeled form controls,\nvisible focus rings, aria-live region for loading/count changes, skip\nlink, prefers-reduced-motion respected. Not run through an automated\nchecker (axe-core) or screen reader — see AI-JOURNAL.md.\n\nTests: 48 Jasmine/Karma tests (services via HttpTestingController,\nPolicyQueryStore with a Router spy, table/filters/pagination/status-badge\ncomponents) — all passing headless in Chrome.\n\nDocker: multi-stage build served via nginx, which also reverse-proxies\n/api/* to the backend container so production has no CORS surface;\ndocker-compose now brings up SQL Server + API + frontend together.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"23ca793451b47fbf5e9ea4199b58ad29d6b4b1a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/git/trees/23ca793451b47fbf5e9ea4199b58ad29d6b4b1a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/git/commits/31697cbf859e64cad5947e386a801651db455694","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commit/31697cbf859e64cad5947e386a801651db455694","node_id":"C_kwDOU0ihtNoAKDMxNjk3Y2JmODU5ZTY0Y2FkNTk0N2UzODZhODAxNjUxZGI0NTU2OTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commit/6b1d0c9fd0542c1cabf46168599d93203f0c8b8c","sha":"6b1d0c9fd0542c1cabf46168599d93203f0c8b8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commits/6b1d0c9fd0542c1cabf46168599d93203f0c8b8c"}],"sha":"31697cbf859e64cad5947e386a801651db455694","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commits/31697cbf859e64cad5947e386a801651db455694"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commits/6b1d0c9fd0542c1cabf46168599d93203f0c8b8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:42:07Z","email":"vishal.gundeti@vhrtechhub.com","name":"Gundeti Vishal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:42:07Z","email":"vishal.gundeti@vhrtechhub.com","name":"Gundeti Vishal"},"message":"Add docker-compose setup, README, and AI working journal\n\ndocker-compose brings up SQL Server 2022 + the API together (health-check\ngated so the API doesn''t race SQL Server''s startup); Dockerfile is a\nstandard multi-stage ASP.NET Core build. Not executed end-to-end — no\nDocker available in this environment, noted honestly in AI-JOURNAL.md\nrather than claiming an unverified pass.\n\nREADME covers run instructions (dotnet run / docker-compose), the API\ncontract, architecture layout, and notable decisions with rationale.\n\nAI-JOURNAL documents the actual build process: package/version conflicts\nfrom the .NET 10 / EF Core 10 ecosystem (Swashbuckle vs OpenApi.NET v2,\ndotnet-ef version mismatch), a real bug caught by manual testing\n(DateTimeOffset unsortable in SQLite), three iterations to get the\nintegration test database isolated correctly, and deliberate scope cuts\n(Kafka bonus, mocking framework, DbContext pooling) with reasoning.\nIncludes results from a lightweight 50-concurrent-request sanity check\nagainst the p95 < 300ms performance target (passed, with caveats — not\na substitute for a real k6/NBomber run against SQL Server).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b3579ad086b2a7262be49a1a8495645bd24ad0a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/git/trees/b3579ad086b2a7262be49a1a8495645bd24ad0a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/git/commits/6b1d0c9fd0542c1cabf46168599d93203f0c8b8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commit/6b1d0c9fd0542c1cabf46168599d93203f0c8b8c","node_id":"C_kwDOU0ihtNoAKDZiMWQwYzlmZDA1NDJjMWNhYmY0NjE2ODU5OWQ5MzIwM2YwYzhiOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commit/f2e7c932b60572eed1c01517725a5331d63d0fdf","sha":"f2e7c932b60572eed1c01517725a5331d63d0fdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commits/f2e7c932b60572eed1c01517725a5331d63d0fdf"}],"sha":"6b1d0c9fd0542c1cabf46168599d93203f0c8b8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commits/6b1d0c9fd0542c1cabf46168599d93203f0c8b8c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commits/f2e7c932b60572eed1c01517725a5331d63d0fdf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:39:41Z","email":"vishal.gundeti@vhrtechhub.com","name":"Gundeti Vishal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:39:41Z","email":"vishal.gundeti@vhrtechhub.com","name":"Gundeti Vishal"},"message":"Add backend test automation: 19 unit tests, 11 integration tests\n\nUnit tests (fast, no I/O): PolicyQueryParameters clamping/sort parsing,\nentity-to-DTO mapping, and PolicyService behavior (empty-flag validation,\nsummary cache hit/miss per distinct filter set) against a hand-rolled\nfake repository instead of a mocking framework.\n\nIntegration tests: WebApplicationFactory<Program> against a real,\nisolated SQLite database per factory instance, seeded with a small\ndeterministic dataset (not the runtime Bogus seeder). Covers pagination,\nevery filter, free-text search, sort (incl. 400 + RFC7807 content-type\non an unknown field), get-by-id 404, summary aggregation, and flag\n(incl. idempotency on re-flagging).\n\nFixes made getting the suite green:\n- CreatedAt/UpdatedAt switched from DateTimeOffset to DateTime: SQLite\n  can''t order by DateTimeOffset, which the default sort surfaced.\n- Swapped AddDbContextPool for AddDbContext and pointed the Testing\n  environment at its own SQLite file via env vars rather than\n  reconfiguring the DbContext after the fact — registering a second EF\n  provider against the same DI container throws at runtime even after\n  removing the DbContextOptions descriptor.\n- Suppressed EF9''s PendingModelChangesWarning (false positive here,\n  verified against the hand-checked schema) so it logs instead of\n  throwing at startup.\n- WriteAsJsonAsync resets Content-Type unless told otherwise, so the\n  RFC7807 ''application/problem+json'' media type is now passed explicitly\n  instead of set beforehand on the response.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5bd77b87094ce7c819490c45d629ab038c13e17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/git/trees/a5bd77b87094ce7c819490c45d629ab038c13e17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/git/commits/f2e7c932b60572eed1c01517725a5331d63d0fdf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commit/f2e7c932b60572eed1c01517725a5331d63d0fdf","node_id":"C_kwDOU0ihtNoAKGYyZTdjOTMyYjYwNTcyZWVkMWMwMTUxNzcyNWE1MzMxZDYzZDBmZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commit/845f4dd7c3dcd8584ff8e01895c7aeac5f6768ad","sha":"845f4dd7c3dcd8584ff8e01895c7aeac5f6768ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commits/845f4dd7c3dcd8584ff8e01895c7aeac5f6768ad"}],"sha":"f2e7c932b60572eed1c01517725a5331d63d0fdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commits/f2e7c932b60572eed1c01517725a5331d63d0fdf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commits/845f4dd7c3dcd8584ff8e01895c7aeac5f6768ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:30:27Z","email":"vishal.gundeti@vhrtechhub.com","name":"Gundeti Vishal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:30:27Z","email":"vishal.gundeti@vhrtechhub.com","name":"Gundeti Vishal"},"message":"Implement Tier 1 backend: domain, application, infrastructure, API\n\n- Domain: Policy entity, PolicyStatus/LineOfBusiness enums matching the\n  spec schema exactly.\n- Application: DTOs, PolicyQueryParameters, IPolicyRepository/IPolicyService\n  abstractions, PolicyService with a short-TTL cache on the summary endpoint\n  (bonus: caching with a documented invalidation strategy).\n- Infrastructure: EF Core PolicyDbContext (SqlServer prod / SQLite dev via\n  config switch), indexes on the filterable columns, Bogus-based seeder\n  producing 220 realistic APAC policy records, initial migration.\n- Api: all four required endpoints (list/detail/flag/summary), Serilog\n  request logging, global exception handling mapped to RFC7807\n  ProblemDetails, /health check, CORS for the future Angular dashboard,\n  and OpenAPI generation + Scalar UI (swapped in for Swashbuckle after\n  it conflicted with the OpenApi.NET v2 that ships with .NET 10).\n\nVerified end-to-end manually: pagination, sorting (incl. 400 on unknown\nsort field), all filters, free-text search, the A&H line-of-business\nalias, bulk flag, 404 on missing id, and summary aggregation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44da48e1bb7c8f32addd449f8c262a44896590f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/git/trees/44da48e1bb7c8f32addd449f8c262a44896590f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/git/commits/845f4dd7c3dcd8584ff8e01895c7aeac5f6768ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commit/845f4dd7c3dcd8584ff8e01895c7aeac5f6768ad","node_id":"C_kwDOU0ihtNoAKDg0NWY0ZGQ3YzNkY2Q4NTg0ZmY4ZTAxODk1YzdhZWFjNWY2NzY4YWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commit/fa57fe5356bfa14ca1e3913cd35b17877fc712bc","sha":"fa57fe5356bfa14ca1e3913cd35b17877fc712bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commits/fa57fe5356bfa14ca1e3913cd35b17877fc712bc"}],"sha":"845f4dd7c3dcd8584ff8e01895c7aeac5f6768ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commits/845f4dd7c3dcd8584ff8e01895c7aeac5f6768ad"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commits/fa57fe5356bfa14ca1e3913cd35b17877fc712bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:21:11Z","email":"vishal.gundeti@vhrtechhub.com","name":"Gundeti Vishal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:21:11Z","email":"vishal.gundeti@vhrtechhub.com","name":"Gundeti Vishal"},"message":"Scaffold solution skeleton and OpenAPI contract\n\nClean Architecture project layout (Domain/Application/Infrastructure/Api\n+ unit/integration test projects) and the contract-first OpenAPI 3.0\nspec for the four required policy endpoints.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1531d6a2b8cd4e54a21f3713c58a0937e748332c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/git/trees/1531d6a2b8cd4e54a21f3713c58a0937e748332c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/git/commits/fa57fe5356bfa14ca1e3913cd35b17877fc712bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commit/fa57fe5356bfa14ca1e3913cd35b17877fc712bc","node_id":"C_kwDOU0ihtNoAKGZhNTdmZTUzNTZiZmExNGNhMWUzOTEzY2QzNWIxNzg3N2ZjNzEyYmM","parents":[],"sha":"fa57fe5356bfa14ca1e3913cd35b17877fc712bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commits/fa57fe5356bfa14ca1e3913cd35b17877fc712bc"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/kotharajashekar41-bot/PolicyManagement.slnx/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=943f51d49dedebcdb119b6bd5c87a355de2e6a26&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A02%3A36.100Z"}');
