80f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:11:16Z","email":"josh@span-eng.com","name":"mathsman5133"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:11:16Z","email":"josh@span-eng.com","name":"mathsman5133"},"message":"Only show flood level fields when Flood Levels is Manual\n\nRiver Level gains a Flood Levels choice (BOM flood maps / Manual). The\nthree level fields are shown, and used, only for Manual, which is what\nWA and NT gauges need since BOM has no river flood maps there.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d2316902c0d9a7187b16602e4f910ae5daa7f2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/git/trees/4d2316902c0d9a7187b16602e4f910ae5daa7f2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/git/commits/8498fe4cf0ebb80456a3fde613c647b7a95380f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/getdoover/bom/commit/8498fe4cf0ebb80456a3fde613c647b7a95380f0","node_id":"C_kwDOU0l3F9oAKDg0OThmZTRjZjBlYmI4MDQ1NmEzZmRlNjEzYzY0N2I3YTk1MzgwZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/getdoover/bom/commit/ddbec14e1549cf846f53a5e6db9320f69bfa0449","sha":"ddbec14e1549cf846f53a5e6db9320f69bfa0449","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/commits/ddbec14e1549cf846f53a5e6db9320f69bfa0449"}],"sha":"8498fe4cf0ebb80456a3fde613c647b7a95380f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/commits/8498fe4cf0ebb80456a3fde613c647b7a95380f0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/commits/ddbec14e1549cf846f53a5e6db9320f69bfa0449/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:06:33Z","email":"josh@span-eng.com","name":"mathsman5133"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:06:33Z","email":"josh@span-eng.com","name":"mathsman5133"},"message":"Look up flood levels from BOM''s flood-warning maps\n\nFlood levels left blank in config are read from the gauge''s popup on\nthe state''s IDx65xxx.html map pages. The page is found once, then only\nthat page is re-read, once a day.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ede65ee606fcca6ce6de33687de482bebc87bc78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/git/trees/ede65ee606fcca6ce6de33687de482bebc87bc78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/git/commits/ddbec14e1549cf846f53a5e6db9320f69bfa0449","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/getdoover/bom/commit/ddbec14e1549cf846f53a5e6db9320f69bfa0449","node_id":"C_kwDOU0l3F9oAKGRkYmVjMTRlMTU0OWNmODQ2ZjUzYTVlNmRiOTMyMGY2OWJmYTA0NDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/getdoover/bom/commit/8e58d43d76679de205086fe8255911cb9d0889a7","sha":"8e58d43d76679de205086fe8255911cb9d0889a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/commits/8e58d43d76679de205086fe8255911cb9d0889a7"}],"sha":"ddbec14e1549cf846f53a5e6db9320f69bfa0449","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/commits/ddbec14e1549cf846f53a5e6db9320f69bfa0449"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/commits/8e58d43d76679de205086fe8255911cb9d0889a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:01:03Z","email":"josh@span-eng.com","name":"mathsman5133"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:01:03Z","email":"josh@span-eng.com","name":"mathsman5133"},"message":"Round the top flood band''s upper limit\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bbb0f7eff0f120989d7c1faf23600e02d0ac57f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/git/trees/bbb0f7eff0f120989d7c1faf23600e02d0ac57f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/git/commits/8e58d43d76679de205086fe8255911cb9d0889a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/getdoover/bom/commit/8e58d43d76679de205086fe8255911cb9d0889a7","node_id":"C_kwDOU0l3F9oAKDhlNThkNDNkNzY2NzlkZTIwNTA4NmZlODI1NTkxMWNiOWQwODg5YTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/getdoover/bom/commit/efa857add3b132ca46b614673dd325d8c8a243cb","sha":"efa857add3b132ca46b614673dd325d8c8a243cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/commits/efa857add3b132ca46b614673dd325d8c8a243cb"}],"sha":"8e58d43d76679de205086fe8255911cb9d0889a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/commits/8e58d43d76679de205086fe8255911cb9d0889a7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/commits/efa857add3b132ca46b614673dd325d8c8a243cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:57:49Z","email":"josh@span-eng.com","name":"mathsman5133"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:57:49Z","email":"josh@span-eng.com","name":"mathsman5133"},"message":"Support SFTP with an SSH key; mark feed settings advanced\n\nFTP Server gains a protocol choice (FTP or SFTP), port and private key,\nso BOM''s Cloud-SFTP registered feed can be used. Schedule, offline\ntimeout, FTP server and file prefixes are now advanced settings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"17b3c3deb38bed78c5013ae233491c1ed290e465","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/git/trees/17b3c3deb38bed78c5013ae233491c1ed290e465"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/git/commits/efa857add3b132ca46b614673dd325d8c8a243cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/getdoover/bom/commit/efa857add3b132ca46b614673dd325d8c8a243cb","node_id":"C_kwDOU0l3F9oAKGVmYTg1N2FkZDNiMTMyY2E0NmI2MTQ2NzNkZDMyNWQ4YzhhMjQzY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/getdoover/bom/commit/71c84cd41ad0e569462a3755898bbaad4cd700ac","sha":"71c84cd41ad0e569462a3755898bbaad4cd700ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/commits/71c84cd41ad0e569462a3755898bbaad4cd700ac"}],"sha":"efa857add3b132ca46b614673dd325d8c8a243cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/commits/efa857add3b132ca46b614673dd325d8c8a243cb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/commits/71c84cd41ad0e569462a3755898bbaad4cd700ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:54:18Z","email":"josh@span-eng.com","name":"mathsman5133"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:54:18Z","email":"josh@span-eng.com","name":"mathsman5133"},"message":"Add flood levels, gauge ranges and icons\n\nRiver Level takes optional minor/moderate/major flood levels, which set\na flood class value and colour bands on the level gauge. Rain values get\nBOM rain-rate bands, and every UI value gets an icon.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a7e3cdd783fc9e20b48717fc2c8068375c377e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/git/trees/0a7e3cdd783fc9e20b48717fc2c8068375c377e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/git/commits/71c84cd41ad0e569462a3755898bbaad4cd700ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/getdoover/bom/commit/71c84cd41ad0e569462a3755898bbaad4cd700ac","node_id":"C_kwDOU0l3F9oAKDcxYzg0Y2Q0MWFkMGU1Njk0NjJhMzc1NTg5OGJiYWFkNGNkNzAwYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/getdoover/bom/commit/5bf768c83227789179b8af18cc0a91072f495340","sha":"5bf768c83227789179b8af18cc0a91072f495340","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/commits/5bf768c83227789179b8af18cc0a91072f495340"}],"sha":"71c84cd41ad0e569462a3755898bbaad4cd700ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/commits/71c84cd41ad0e569462a3755898bbaad4cd700ac"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/commits/5bf768c83227789179b8af18cc0a91072f495340/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T07:52:37Z","email":"josh@span-eng.com","name":"mathsman5133"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T07:52:37Z","email":"josh@span-eng.com","name":"mathsman5133"},"message":"Add Bureau of Meteorology processor\n\nPolls BOM''s flood-warning FTP feed every 15 minutes and records river\nlevel and rainfall for one location, writing each reading into history\nat its BOM observation time. FTP server, login and file prefixes are\nconfigurable for Registered User (5-minute) feeds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd1a2080857ec69dd50e902b108d748ae94e3b47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/git/trees/dd1a2080857ec69dd50e902b108d748ae94e3b47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/git/commits/5bf768c83227789179b8af18cc0a91072f495340","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/getdoover/bom/commit/5bf768c83227789179b8af18cc0a91072f495340","node_id":"C_kwDOU0l3F9oAKDViZjc2OGM4MzIyNzc4OTE3OWI4YWYxOGNjMGE5MTA3MmY0OTUzNDA","parents":[],"sha":"5bf768c83227789179b8af18cc0a91072f495340","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/commits/5bf768c83227789179b8af18cc0a91072f495340"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/getdoover/bom/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=dbdddf7b10d184d63e831fd3831f7d3a5a0db7c6&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A38%3A12.205Z"}');
