n  - First-run detection and launch tracking\n  - Storage abstraction layer for testability\n  - Workshop: Full settings screen with theme/language/font controls\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017fCKJZ7aeAi1YbWiH7nESP","tree":{"sha":"0b69a8777b0816c8280a866a85ea127dbfbf1fa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudidc42/flutter_course/git/trees/0b69a8777b0816c8280a866a85ea127dbfbf1fa4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cloudidc42/flutter_course/git/commits/0f29a0a2ffa465cee7b7289962e2816142efd7ea","verification":{"payload":"tree 0b69a8777b0816c8280a866a85ea127dbfbf1fa4\nparent e6eb5228d8ca0630d976d360fd6a17236d599b89\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790758905 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790758905 +0000\n\nAdd missing parts 10 and 20 to complete the full 50-part curriculum\n\n- Part 10: Assets, Images, Icons (Steps 91-100)\n  - pubspec.yaml asset/font configuration\n  - AssetImage, NetworkImage, FadeInImage, CachedNetworkImage\n  - Image effects: blur, ColorFilter, ClipRRect, ShaderMask\n  - Icons, IconButton variants, SVG with flutter_svg\n  - CustomPaint for shapes and charts\n  - Workshop: Photo Gallery with Hero animations\n\n- Part 20: SharedPreferences & Secure Storage (Steps 191-200)\n  - SharedPreferences CRUD for all primitive types\n  - JSON-serialized complex objects in prefs\n  - AppSettings ChangeNotifier pattern\n  - flutter_secure_storage with Keychain/Keystore encryption\n  - Auth token management with expiry checking\n  - First-run detection and launch tracking\n  - Storage abstraction layer for testability\n  - Workshop: Full settings screen with theme/language/font controls\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017fCKJZ7aeAi1YbWiH7nESP\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsB