r","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaikhsaquib/ERPAngularProject/commits/e8e53ee8f295149771f6f4669951356209924ccb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:49:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:49:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"refactor(components): standardize every component to the four-file shape\n\n14 components were using an inline template/style (or missing a spec\nentirely) instead of the repo''s standard .ts/.html/.scss/.spec.ts shape:\n13 stub placeholder pages across application-services, compliance,\ness-mss and hr-essentials, plus apps/shell''s auth-callback component.\nExtracted each inline template into its own .html, added a .scss file,\nand wrote a .spec.ts for every one of them (auth-callback''s covers the\nmissing-code, success and failure paths). Also added the one missing\nspec on feature-home''s dashboard page.\n\nVerified: full lint (28/28), full test (27/27, all passing), and the\nshell''s production build all still green.","tree":{"sha":"e07347917eb54a313a617d17d2bb050c63e9183c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaikhsaquib/ERPAngularProject/git/trees/e07347917eb54a313a617d17d2bb050c63e9183c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaikhsaquib/ERPAngularProject/git/commits/e8e53ee8f295149771f6f4669951356209924ccb","verification":{"payload":"tree e07347917eb54a313a617d17d2bb050c63e9183c\nparent d8c9dd78e096a63c80d8d004e9d6111362689e0d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790776192 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790776192 +0000\n\nrefactor(components): standardize every component to the four-file shape\n\n14 components were using an inline template/style (or missing a spec\nentirely) instead of the repo''s standard .ts/.html/.scss/.spec.ts shape:\n13 stub placeholder pages across application-services, compliance,\ness-mss and hr-essentials, plus apps/shell''s auth-callback component.\nExtracted each inline template into its own .html, added a .scss file,\nand wrote a .spec.ts for every one of them (auth-callback''s covers the\nmissing-code, success and failure paths). Also added the one missing\nspec on feature-home''s dashboard page.\n\nVerified: full lint (28/28), full test (27/27, all passing), and the\nshell''s production build all still green.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBDLx65C\nBFkYetZ7EFTR0ce8egrlpeXmOH3yJGU7AP3QAxdfUGOtKUzJw9GS0Flz4lDeMe9oEhQ3pYkVaGYO\n3Qk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T13:50:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shaikhsaquib/ERPAngularProject/commit/e8e53ee8f295149771f6f4669951356209924ccb","node_id":"C_kwDOU04bvtoAKGU4ZTUzZWU4ZjI5NTE0OTc3MWY2ZjQ2Njk5NTEzNTYyMDk5MjRjY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shaikhsaquib/ERPAngularProject/commit/d8c9dd78e096a63c80d8d004e9d6111362689e0d","sha":"d8c9dd78e096a63c80d8d004e9d6111362689e0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaikhsaquib/ERPAngularProject/commits/d8c9dd78e096a63c80d8d004e9d6111362689e0d"}],"sha":"e8e53ee8f295149771f6f4669951356209924ccb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaikhsaquib/ERPAngularProject/commits/e8e53ee8f295149771f6f4669951356209924ccb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaikhsaquib/ERPAngularProject/commits/d8c9dd78e096a63c80d8d004e9d6111362689e0d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T12:36:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T12:36:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(storybook): serve design tokens as a static file, not a JS import\n\nStorybook''s Angular webpack builder scopes its CSS loader to each\nproject''s own source tree, so libs/shared/ui and libs/shared/patterns\nimporting libs/shared/tokens'' stylesheet from preview.ts fell through\nwith no loader matched at all (\"Module parse failed ... no loaders are\nconfigured to process this file\"). Switched to Storybook''s own\nstatic-file mechanism instead: staticDirs serves tokens.css over HTTP,\nand preview-head.html links to it directly, bypassing the webpack\nmodule graph (and its project-boundary scoping) entirely.","tree":{"sha":"3fe035e8bd800d2bef9d12edb37fed971cf64329","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaikhsaquib/ERPAngularProject/git/trees/3fe035e8bd800d2bef9d12edb37fed971cf64329"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaikhsaquib/ERPAngularProject/git/commits/d8c9dd78e096a63c80d8d004e9d6111362689e0d","verification":{"payload":"tree 3fe035e8bd800d2bef9d12edb37fed971cf64329\nparent c197324d6c2598561a43fa138b02aaf473bfd54d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790771803 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790771803 +0000\n\nfix(storybook): serve design tokens as a static file, not a JS import\n\nStorybook''s Angular webpack builder scopes its CSS loader to each\nproject''s own source tree, so libs/shared/ui and libs/shared/patterns\nimporting libs/shared/tokens'' stylesheet from preview.ts fell through\nwith no loader matched at all (\"Module parse failed ... no loaders are\nconfigured to process this file\"). Switched to Storybook''s own\nstatic-file mechanism instead: staticDirs serves tokens.css over HTTP,\nand preview-head.html links to it directly, bypassing the webpack\nmodule graph (and its project-boundary scoping) entirely.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMTr3IUo\nHQb9Efk3JZHAU8QfEM20O5p5nAxhv9PpNN5oWuMSnXkNLROo/iSDZwGTl6OepdwJULfxywqpSyaM\nIgA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T12:37:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shaikhsaquib/ERPAngularProject/commit/d8c9dd78e096a63c80d8d004e9d6111362689e0d","node_id":"C_kwDOU04bvtoAKGQ4YzlkZDc4ZTA5NmE2M2M4MGQ4ZDAwNGU5ZDYxMTEzNjI2ODllMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shaikhsaquib/ERPAngularProject/commit/c197324d6c2598561a43fa138b02aaf473bfd54d","sha":"c197324d6c2598561a43fa138b02aaf473bfd54d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaikhsaquib/ERPAngularProject/commits/c197324d6c2598561a43fa138b02aaf473bfd54d"}],"sha":"d8c9dd78e096a63c80d8d004e9d6111362689e0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaikhsaquib/ERPAngularProject/commits/d8c9dd78e096a63c80d8d004e9d6111362689e0d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaikhsaquib/ERPAngularProject/commits/c197324d6c2598561a43fa138b02aaf473bfd54d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T12:34:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T12:34:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(shared-tokens): rename tokens partial to a real .css file\n\nStorybook''s webpack pipeline (resolve-url-loader -> sass-loader) choked\non a .scss file with zero actual Sass syntax being imported cross-project\ninto each library''s preview.ts, and a bare .scss extension also required\nSass-only // comments that plain CSS doesn''t allow once the file is\nloaded as CSS interop. Renamed _tokens.scss -> tokens.css (content is,\nand always was, plain CSS) and switched every consumer (apps/shell''s\nglobal stylesheet, both Storybook previews) to Sass''s native \"@use\n''foo.css''\" plain-CSS-interop syntax. Converted the file''s // comments to\n/* */ block comments to match. Verified: shell still builds clean\n(production budget intact), full lint (28/28) still passes.","tree":{"sha":"a9d2c8c67bb044f039c36ac726ceff0ce3656e0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaikhsaquib/ERPAngularProject/git/trees/a9d2c8c67bb044f039c36ac726ceff0ce3656e0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaikhsaquib/ERPAngularProject/git/commits/c197324d6c2598561a43fa138b02aaf473bfd54d","verification":{"payload":"tree a9d2c8c67bb044f039c36ac726ceff0ce3656e0a\nparent e78c9e86ec6b34814e8733fc901b03ef988594b3\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790771642 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790771642 +0000\n\nfix(shared-tokens): rename tokens partial to a real .css file\n\nStorybook''s webpack pipeline (resolve-url-loader -> sass-loader) choked\non a .scss file with zero actual Sass syntax being imported cross-project\ninto each library''s preview.ts, and a bare .scss extension also required\nSass-only // comments that plain CSS doesn''t allow once the file is\nloaded as CSS interop. Renamed _tokens.scss -> tokens.css (content is,\nand always was, plain CSS) and switched every consumer (apps/shell''s\nglobal stylesheet, both Storybook previews) to Sass''s native \"@use\n''foo.css''\" plain-CSS-interop syntax. Converted the file''s // comments to\n/* */ block comments to match. Verified: shell still builds clean\n(production budget intact), full lint (28/28) still passes.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHaONf/v\n0fJwweTyMtDqgbaHBCCRjiMbwNhBAWlv9m9XvSxf16adSV/4tkAabaNpd3VB8j5UUr/A5R60rrA9\n/AI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T12:37:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/use