a non-interactive hang\n\nStorybook''s first-run telemetry consent prompt blocks on stdin\nindefinitely in a non-TTY shell (discovered while verifying the\nbuild-storybook targets locally). Disabled it both ways: the\nSTORYBOOK_DISABLE_TELEMETRY env var for CI, and core.disableTelemetry\nin each .storybook/main.ts so local contributors don''t hit it either.","tree":{"sha":"69e5fe1eecaa725ff78af92e56da163dafb69952","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaikhsaquib/ERPAngularProject/git/trees/69e5fe1eecaa725ff78af92e56da163dafb69952"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shaikhsaquib/ERPAngularProject/git/commits/e78c9e86ec6b34814e8733fc901b03ef988594b3","verification":{"payload":"tree 69e5fe1eecaa725ff78af92e56da163dafb69952\nparent 9551f7f13e5ff8bd03cf6d1a9d5740b366ba75b8\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790771432 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790771432 +0000\n\nfix(ci): disable Storybook telemetry to avoid a non-interactive hang\n\nStorybook''s first-run telemetry consent prompt blocks on stdin\nindefinitely in a non-TTY shell (discovered while verifying the\nbuild-storybook targets locally). Disabled it both ways: the\nSTORYBOOK_DISABLE_TELEMETRY env var for CI, and core.disableTelemetry\nin each .storybook/main.ts so local contributors don''t hit it either.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOX7njpT\nFwmRAlJIY1UchGxMcF7I70/GxBcmsS/KJN4QlItskwWXX8LPbux3RhYIf+y4JgpcS+lgvldQCN4H\noAg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T12:37:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https:/