rk/github/Neo0749/neo-fork-gotangra/hdyadmin-template/vip/frontend/admin/src/locales/en-US.json:7)\n- [AppId (line 60)](/Volumes/Work/github/Neo0749/neo-fork-gotangra/hdyadmin-template/vip/app/admin/cmd/server/main.go:60)\n- [OpenAPI (line 6)](/Volumes/Work/github/Neo0749/neo-fork-gotangra/hdyadmin-template/vip/app/admin/cmd/server/assets/openapi.yaml:6)\n- 前端 dist 已重新生成\n验证通过：\n- make gen\n- make api-lint\n- make test\n- make build-server\n- make frontend-build\n- 全新生成 acme-loyalty 回归测试通过\n现在 vip/ 的业务文件和前端构建产物中已无 hdyadmin。只有 vip/scripts/new-module.sh 保留了官方模板仓库地址及用于匹配原模板的常量，这是生成器正常工作所必需的。","tree":{"sha":"6844ccacd808c6f9b7b4e8af7be88f415d53899f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lily0749labs/hdyadmin-template/git/trees/6844ccacd808c6f9b7b4e8af7be88f415d53899f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lily0749labs/hdyadmin-template/git/commits/82b65bdda364aa0249c49ac2158f0f202fe630ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204691322?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andy880523/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andy880523/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andy880523/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andy880523/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Andy880523","id":204691322,"login":"Andy880523","node_id":"U_kgDODDNXeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andy880523/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andy880523/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andy880523/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andy880523/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andy880523/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andy880523","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lily