.noreply.github.com","name":"Kartik"},"message":"M5 bring-up on hardware; live evening test failure diagnosed (room HF noise, not Wi-Fi)\n\n- Wi-Fi + warm TCP connected to the ingest server (E-32)\n- live test: v2b 0 detections under evening noise (E-33); controlled Wi-Fi on/off A/B rejects the\n  RF-interference hypothesis; evening room +10-15 dB at 5-8 kHz vs afternoon (E-34)\n- server/latency_report.py (L1 measured, L2 = L1 + in-stream detection lag + [EST] capture delta)\n- model/eval/event_scan.py (unlabelled-session diagnostic)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nOriginal-commit: 6ccc4609292373cd16797f7556f30a93d4d8bd73","tree":{"sha":"a051d59821947e852aefcc34c502d0d277dfe249","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kartikinfinity/vayro-edge-voice-activator/git/trees/a051d59821947e852aefcc34c502d0d277dfe249"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kartikinfinity/vayro-edge-voice-activator/git/commits/bfc2a5617e657c24d0dda243e6244df917d1b76d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179582332?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kartikinfinity","id":179582332,"login":"Kartikinfinity","node_id":"U_kgDOCrQ1fA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/subscriptio