artikinfinity","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kartikinfinity/vayro-edge-voice-activator/commits/2e5f0c31904a2ee5f81f54f4e9a9fa58525b835c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T12:56:17Z","email":"179582332+Kartikinfinity@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kartik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T12:56:17Z","email":"179582332+Kartikinfinity@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kartik"},"message":"M5 streaming code, v2 data pipeline, protocol v2, live-device evaluation\n\n- firmware: audio_ring (unified 1.0 s ring), netstream (Wi-Fi STA, warm TCP, 8-byte header,\n  624 ms pre-roll, server END/timeout/OVERRUN, NTP-style clock pings), trigger -> stream wiring\n- server/ingest.py: packet timestamps, PONG, per-activation WAV/JSON, L1 via clock offset\n- model: TTS v2 (faster speech, Hey+X confusables), real-run training windows, prompt_score,\n  single-chunk FA evaluation, device-trigger and per-prompt evaluators\n- host: protocol v2 (4 s windows, next-prompt preview), BOM-tolerant scripts\n- build: optional extra defaults / build tag, 1.5 MB app partition; sdkconfig.wifi gitignored\n- docs: DEC-19..21, ledger E-26..E-29, selection rule declared before v2 results\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nOriginal-commit: 3eb27f394fa4b39d3253a566a0871cf9a471c5d0","tree":{"sha":"bf6be3e3754ad49839845be58d9703539fe5c51f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kartikinfinity/vayro-edge-voice-activator/git/trees/bf6be3e3754ad49839845be58d9703539fe5c51f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kartikinfinity/vayro-edge-voice-activator/git/commits/2e5f0c31904a2ee5f81f54f4e9a9fa58525b835c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179582332?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfi