OCrQ1fA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kartikinfinity/vayro-edge-voice-activator/commits/30d5e80d2c32c9407e75cf114330c57a82f7a3a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:33:28Z","email":"179582332+Kartikinfinity@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kartik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:33:28Z","email":"179582332+Kartikinfinity@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kartik"},"message":"M2 parity PASS, M3 model on device (esp-tflite-micro + esp-nn), training pipeline\n\n- microfrontend: table-hash diagnostic (@FETAB), canonical host tables injected on device (DEC-16);\n  device features bit-exact with the host twin\n- kws_engine: TFLM interpreter, generated model_data.c (model + frontend SHA check + input LUT)\n- app: windowed inference every 6 frames, N-mean/threshold/2 s refractory, GPIO 15 pulse, @KW,\n  posterior frames, @PERF cycle counters (inference vs front end)\n- model/: TTS generator (Piper, DEC-14), dataset builder (device-identical streams), train.py,\n  export.py (static batch, DEC-17), eval_stream.py (robust keyword labeller), posterior_parity.py\n- deps: esp-tflite-micro 1.4.1, esp-nn 1.4.1 pinned in dependencies.lock\n- docs: DEC-16..18, ledger E-21..E-25\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nOriginal-commit: a5e497ebdb1d4fd728090fdace7a4900458758c2","tree":{"sha":"35190b9be3bf66c4a0728ae2fc53f2e12c95a305","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kartikinfinity/vayro-edge-voice-activator/git/trees/35190b9be3