 hourly chunking, --script-file prompts with labels\n- instrument: @BOOT date without spaces\n- host/scripts/kw_session_v1.txt: \"Hey Vayro\" recording protocol (25 kw, 16 hard negatives)\n- docs: DEC-08 keyword, DEC-09 keep >>16, DEC-10 keep MIC_SETTLE 300 ms; ledger E-04/06/07/19/20\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nOriginal-commit: 1933941d9f6eea3e1dd73805223d766b63bb6f16","tree":{"sha":"10dcb960d27702376e4c72bdf2e3e6afd9715223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kartikinfinity/vayro-edge-voice-activator/git/trees/10dcb960d27702376e4c72bdf2e3e6afd9715223"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kartikinfinity/vayro-edge-voice-activator/git/commits/3e925846efe09ab22360c6ff0ad4fd5ede58c3ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179582332?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kartikinfinity","id":179582332,"login":"Kartikinfinity","node_id":"U_kgDOCrQ1fA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kartikinfinity/vayro-edge-voice-activator/commit/3e925846efe09ab22360c6ff0ad4fd5ede58c3ef","node_id":"C_kwDOU1KXSNoAKDNlOTI1OD