g by measurement, scripted capture\n\n- sdkconfig.board: real wiring (SCK=6 WS=5 SD=4) and MSB RX framing; the alignment\n  sweep showed Philips captures one bit late (E-18)\n- audio_capture: selectable framing and BCK edge; boot-time alignment sweep\n- serial_link: host start byte before I2S start; 1 s USB write timeout\n- capture.py: --cold/--reset handling, scripted prompts with recorded segment\n  boundaries; analyze_audio.py uses them\n- idf.ps1: regenerate sdkconfig when any defaults file changes\n- docs: ledger E-02..E-05, E-17..E-19; state DEC-06/07, C-11/C-12, hardware facts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nOriginal-commit: aa79caf9340a47f46a417ae565f9c4f68f0ad6fd","tree":{"sha":"e41a86cbb6755ec2dc23ec175108a513e654eaee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kartikinfinity/vayro-edge-voice-activator/git/trees/e41a86cbb6755ec2dc23ec175108a513e654eaee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kartikinfinity/vayro-edge-voice-activator/git/commits/ee347661478e8e0ede72be868de3f13dc523fdd8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179582332?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kartikinfinity","id":179582332,"login":"Kartikinfinity","node_id":"U_kgDOCrQ1fA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kartikinfinity/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"http