/ChiriNNi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChiriNNi/Student-Feedback-AI/commits/603abd22f96102e763de2ae0057221c4829a1352/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T05:37:07Z","email":"bekarysbulat@gmail.com","name":"="},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T05:37:07Z","email":"bekarysbulat@gmail.com","name":"="},"message":"Add ban/delete, full-page admin panel, password policy and session revocation\n\n- Admin: ban (with optional reason) / unban / delete users; bans take effect\n  immediately, including already-issued tokens; profile edits never lift a ban;\n  admins cannot ban, delete or demote themselves\n- Admin panel moved to its own full-page view: stats tiles, search, role and\n  status filters, sortable table (cards on mobile), modal create/edit and\n  confirm dialogs\n- Password policy (app/passwords.py) enforced server-side for registration,\n  admin-created accounts and password changes: rejects common passwords,\n  leetspeak/\"word+digits\" variants, sequences, repetition and personal info\n- token_version in every JWT: changing or resetting a password revokes all\n  previously issued sessions; the session that made the change gets a fresh token\n- Idempotent ALTER TABLE on startup for the new users columns\n- Global [hidden] rule so author display styles can''t override it\n- README updated\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3537812a7a89214f678c76b6a04e55a6b7a27156","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChiriNNi/Student-Feedback-AI/git/trees/3537812a7a89214f678c76b6a04e55a6b7a27156"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChiriNNi/Student-Feedback-AI/git/commits/603abd22f96102e763de2ae0057221c4829a1352","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103880918?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChiriNNi/events{/privacy}","follo