rl":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/commits/cc92ffaa09a357f7d44743eeade6da7315158c2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:42:20Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:42:20Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"test(e2e): restore demo upstreams as fixtures and rewrite placeholder specs\n\nThe suite started services/user-service and services/order-service, which\nwere deleted. They return as dependency-free fixtures under apps/e2e, and\ntest-e2e.sh registers them for the seeded demo org (the seed no longer\ndoes). The seed also needs REDIS_URL now.\n\nThe placeholder specs targeted UI and endpoints that don''t exist. They are\nreplaced by API-level specs against the running stack (services, consumer\nkeys, drift and canary patches, inbox, health, metrics, SSE) using their\nown user. Multi-instance and resilience behaviour is covered by the\nintegration tests; report-service.spec targeted an app that isn''t started.\n\nCI uses the runner''s Chrome instead of installing Playwright browsers from\nthe repository root, where Playwright isn''t a dependency.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MEPoj8w3zTWAQGNCtt6cSN","tree":{"sha":"686663bd0ab33333f245b7c7d67286b7e3721754","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/git/trees/686663bd0ab33333f245b7c7d67286b7e3721754"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/git/commits/cc92ffaa09a357f7d44743eeade6da7315158c2e","verification":{"payload":"tree 686663bd0ab33333f245b7c7d67286b7e3721754\nparent daf1ce955acaee8a1e4b32f3d334565f05780d87\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791196940 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791196940 +0000\n\ntest(e2e): restore demo upstreams as fixtures and rewrite placeholder specs\n\nThe suite started services/user-service and services/order-service, which\nwere deleted. They return as dependency-free fixtures under apps/e2e, and\ntest-e2e.sh registers them for the seeded demo org (the seed no longer\ndoes). The seed also needs REDIS_URL now.\n\nThe placeholder specs targeted UI and endpoints that don''t exist. They are\nreplaced by API-level specs against the running stack (services, consumer\nkeys, drift and canary patches, inbox, health, metrics, SSE) using their\nown user. Multi-instance and resilience behaviour is covered by the\nintegration tests; report-service.spec targeted an app that isn''t started.\n\nCI uses the runner''s Chrome instead of installing Playwright browsers from\nthe repository root, where Playwright isn''t a dependency.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MEPoj8w3zTWAQGNCtt6cSN\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMzv7oIc\nZIPohKapqsq6MkCJ4DDzAu3+YPSovtwsij/dhdhqdoAVb7BBRAaIO3Uy1SAb7mXraliGxIBED9+f\nogI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T10: