"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/commits/daf1ce955acaee8a1e4b32f3d334565f05780d87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:42:20Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:42:20Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(gateway): boot without demo env vars, deliver events once, fix health probes\n\n- main.ts required SUPABASE_*, USER_SERVICE_URL, ORDER_SERVICE_URL and a\n  non-empty GEMINI_API_KEY, so the gateway refused to start with a valid\n  DATABASE_URL setup or without Gemini. loadGatewayConfig already validates\n  the configuration, so the extra list is gone.\n- Every event reached local subscribers twice (local Subject plus the Redis\n  echo), so notifications were duplicated. Redis messages now carry the\n  publishing instance id and are skipped by it, and side-effect subscribers\n  (notifications, drift memory) use localStream() so each event is handled\n  once across instances.\n- /health and /health/ready used Express''s res.json() on Fastify and failed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MEPoj8w3zTWAQGNCtt6cSN","tree":{"sha":"9aca58162c9d69c4f4ce7177a7105fea61648209","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/git/trees/9aca58162c9d69c4f4ce7177a7105fea61648209"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/git/commits/daf1ce955acaee8a1e4b32f3d334565f05780d87","verification":{"payload":"tree 9aca58162c9d69c4f4ce7177a7105fea61648209\nparent d1044ee34a2b5aaa2436283aa4b13547e87e08d3\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791196940 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791196940 +0000\n\nfix(gateway): boot without demo env vars, deliver events once, fix health probes\n\n- main.ts required SUPABASE_*, USER_SERVICE_URL, ORDER_SERVICE_URL and a\n  non-empty GEMINI_API_KEY, so the gateway refused to start with a valid\n  DATABASE_URL setup or without Gemini. loadGatewayConfig already validates\n  the configuration, so the extra list is gone.\n- Every event reached local subscribers twice (local Subject plus the Redis\n  echo), so notifications were duplicated. Redis messages now carry the\n  publishing instance id and are skipped by it, and side-effect subscribers\n  (notifications, drift memory) use localStream() so each event is handled\n  once across instances.\n- /health and /health/ready used Express''s res.json() on Fastify and failed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MEPoj8w3zTWAQGNCtt6cSN\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFYE1BaI\nnsM1HXYxQ7H0QBdCwUVYKNTBPsP4SMJaoFRxJTiJ3ivmSnh+Zj5Vj70W/1KAfjdhT9Y6udee7OYF\nlwQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T10:42:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cl