s/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/commits/d1044ee34a2b5aaa2436283aa4b13547e87e08d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:29:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:29:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"test(integration): rewrite placeholder tests against the real gateway\n\ncircuit-breaker, contracts-advanced, healing-concurrency, permissions and\nservices imported missing helpers, called endpoints that don''t exist, used\nunsigned tokens or only exercised Redis itself. They now share a harness\n(migrated database, local JWKS, compiled gateway) and test the real code.\nMigrations take an advisory lock so concurrent test files don''t race.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MEPoj8w3zTWAQGNCtt6cSN","tree":{"sha":"f6dcd52458a5fe327495ccd5739b56684c0c567d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/git/trees/f6dcd52458a5fe327495ccd5739b56684c0c567d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/git/commits/d1044ee34a2b5aaa2436283aa4b13547e87e08d3","verification":{"payload":"tree f6dcd52458a5fe327495ccd5739b56684c0c567d\nparent 42bf1afa32dd8f6e9c6083587025a7f81b39ee9f\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791196150 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791196150 +0000\n\ntest(integration): rewrite placeholder tests against the real gateway\n\ncircuit-breaker, contracts-advanced, healing-concurrency, permissions and\nservices imported missing helpers, called endpoints that don''t exist, used\nunsigned tokens or only exercised Redis itself. They now share a 