"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/commits/d8daed69ae874607e9cec041a50d3f6a474fa943/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:47:01Z","email":"faizanblink34@gmail.com","name":"Faizan Shamas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:47:01Z","email":"faizanblink34@gmail.com","name":"Faizan Shamas"},"message":"feat: complete production-readiness initiatives (Phase 7, OTEL, load testing)\n\n## Phase 7: Report-Service Integration\n- Export PatchRegistry and DriftEvent types from shared-types\n- Fix field mappings: generatedAt→createdAt, repairedAt→isBreaking\n- Implement report storage: /api/reports/:orgSlug, /api/reports/:orgSlug/contracts\n- Add health endpoints: /health, /health/ready\n- Add webhook ingestion: /api/webhooks/healing for healing events\n- Create separate controllers for health, storage, and webhooks\n- Fix gateway client endpoint paths to use /governance/ prefix\n- All e2e tests passing\n\n## Phase 2: OTEL Tracing Infrastructure\n- Create AsyncLocalStorage context wrapper (packages/core/src/observability/context.ts)\n- Provides request-scoped context for trace IDs, span IDs, request IDs, org/user IDs\n- Ready for propagation to upstream-client, gemini-client, dashboard\n\n## Phase 3: Load Testing Suite\n- Create k6 load testing framework (apps/load-tests/)\n  - Baseline throughput test (100 VUs, 5min, p95<500ms)\n  - Circuit breaker resilience test (verify 30s recovery)\n  - Canary isolation test (80/20 split, verify no baseline degradation)\n- Export canary metrics to Prometheus:\n  - gateway_canary_success_rate\n  - gateway_canary_error_rate\n  - gateway_canary_latency_ms\n  - gateway_canary_baseline_ratio\n- Comprehensive load testing documentation (docs/load-test-results.md)\n  - Test scenarios, expected results, Prometheus alerting rules\n  - Production deployment checklist, troubleshooting guide\n\n## Infrastructure Updates\n- Update TypeScript config for report-service (experimentalDecorators, module resolution)\n- Extend MetricsService with canary metrics gauges\n- Update CanaryMetricsService to export metrics to Prometheus on every fetch\n\nBuild: ✅ All packages compile successfully\nTests: ✅ E2E tests passing for report-service","tree":{"sha":"7ba69c71b1da649f097910f3a7b4096cc769273c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/git/trees/7ba69c71b1da649f097910f3a7b4096cc769273c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/git/commits/d8daed69ae874607e9cec041a50d3f6a474fa943","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76534891?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/faizan2002-npm","id":76534891,"login":"faizan2002-npm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTM0ODkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/commit/d8daed69ae874607e9cec041a50d3f6a474fa943","node_id":"C_kwDOU23jrtoAKGQ4ZGFlZDY5YWU4NzQ2MDdlOWNlYzA0MWE1MGQzZjZhNDc0ZmE5NDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrat