\n- High latency P99: > 500ms for 2 minutes\n- Database pool exhausted: > 90% connections for 5 minutes\n- Redis connection lost: Unreachable for 1 minute\n- Circuit breaker open: Stuck for 5+ minutes\n\nWarning alerts (business hours):\n- Latency warning: P95 > 300ms for 5 minutes\n- Error rate warning: > 0.5% for 5 minutes\n- Patch generation failures: > 30% failure rate for 10 minutes\n- Lock contention: > 5 instances waiting\n\nOn-call runbooks for each alert:\n- Investigation: Which metrics to check, what commands to run\n- Common causes: Root cause analysis\n- Recovery: Concrete steps to resolve\n- Escalation: When to involve other teams\n\nEnables:\n- Automated alerting via Prometheus Alertmanager\n- Quick incident resolution with runbook guidance\n- Systematic tracking of SLO violations\n- Error budget tracking for capacity planning","tree":{"sha":"656f47ca0b507692d7ebe3618b954748645f03c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/git/trees/656f47ca0b507692d7ebe3618b954748645f03c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/git/commits/7b16fea199eacf4b0a419ecad4988c70c9c2e8dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76534891?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/faizan2002-npm","id":76534891,"login":"faizan2002-npm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTM0ODkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/use