pi.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/commits/1dee86eebe6d8e09b795ad3531adc064e17c6e87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:10:05Z","email":"faizanblink34@gmail.com","name":"Faizan Shamas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:10:05Z","email":"faizanblink34@gmail.com","name":"Faizan Shamas"},"message":"docs: add production-readiness documentation\n\n* **multi-instance.md**: PostgreSQL/Redis setup, Kubernetes deployment, distributed healing locks, event propagation, connection pooling, scaling considerations, disaster recovery procedures, monitoring and troubleshooting\n\n* **resilience.md**: Circuit breaker patterns (CLOSED/OPEN/HALF_OPEN), timeout configuration per operation, exponential backoff retry logic with jitter, bulkhead/rate limiting, fallback strategies, cascading failure prevention, observability metrics, configuration options, testing approaches, production SLOs\n\n* **report-service.md**: Backend consumer example app, SSE event subscription, API endpoints for reports and metrics, deployment (Kubernetes/Docker), authentication, integration with external systems (Grafana, Prometheus), troubleshooting guide\n\nEach document includes:\n- Architecture diagrams\n- Configuration examples\n- Monitoring/alerting rules\n- Failure scenarios and recovery\n- Troubleshooting procedures\n- Next steps checklists","tree":{"sha":"09f608b4ce55406ce686bee97ad794e5c0d87961","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe