e**: Add GitHub Actions jobs for unit tests, integration tests (with Docker Postgres/Redis), and e2e tests (with Playwright/Chrome)\n* **Skipped Tests Fix**: Remove test.skip() from health probe unhealthy scenario and refactor test to validate response structure\n* **Swagger/OpenAPI**: Add @nestjs/swagger and @nestjs/throttler dependencies; document health and metrics endpoints with @ApiOperation and @ApiResponse decorators\n* **Prometheus Monitoring**: Add prom-client dependency; register HttpMetricsInterceptor globally to track request latency and HTTP status codes\n* **E2E Tests**: Create multi-instance.spec.ts (distributed healing lock), resilience.spec.ts (circuit breaker/timeouts), and report-service.spec.ts (backend consumer events)\n* **Integration Tests**: Create multi-instance.test.mjs (Redis lock contention, pub/sub events) and circuit-breaker.test.mjs (state transitions, failure detection)\n* **Test Script Updates**: Add new integration and e2e tests to test:live script for CI automation\n\nAddresses production-readiness blockers: missing test coverage in CI, incomplete Swagger docs, and lack of observability metrics.","tree":{"sha":"8fdcca87242720f97e77a58da169c87984518112","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/git/trees/8fdcca87242720f97e77a58da169c87984518112"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/git/commits/3d1785f1d8e4a272ac42046c296fcbd0c26b6e04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76534891?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https: