{"date":"2026-10-05T04:33:46Z","email":"faizanblink34@gmail.com","name":"Faizan Shamas"},"message":"refactor: remove redundant test scripts, consolidate documentation\n\n- Remove test-ci.sh, test-coverage.sh (redundant with pnpm test:all, pnpm test:jest:coverage)\n- Consolidate EXTENDED-TESTS.md into TEST-GUIDE.md (single source of truth)\n- Keep original test-e2e.sh, test-integration.sh (used by npm scripts)\n- npm scripts now provide all functionality:\n  - pnpm test:all = full verification ladder\n  - pnpm test:jest:coverage = coverage reports\n  - pnpm test:e2e, test:integration = full suites\n  - Individual test suites: test:e2e:services, etc.\n- TEST-GUIDE.md now covers all testing strategies (unit, integration, e2e)","tree":{"sha":"79fed180de9dd7770770016cd8be511d4f322ea5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/git/trees/79fed180de9dd7770770016cd8be511d4f322ea5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/git/commits/f235fc2b66d86b391465b0d2316526083169e5ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76534891?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/faizan2002-npm","id":76534891,"login":"faizan2002-npm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTM0ODkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/starred{/owner}{/