":{"date":"2026-10-05T04:05:46Z","email":"faizanblink34@gmail.com","name":"Faizan Shamas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T04:05:46Z","email":"faizanblink34@gmail.com","name":"Faizan Shamas"},"message":"feat(openapi): import OpenAPI specs as contract baselines\n\n- core: parseOpenApi / tokensFromJsonSchema turn OpenAPI 3.x and Swagger 2.0\n  response schemas into the same path:type tokens as observed responses\n  ($ref, allOf, oneOf/anyOf, nullable, 3.1 type arrays, enums, base paths),\n  plus template path matching; unit-tested against flattenPayload\n- service_operations table and service_registries.openapi import summary\n- Import from pasted/uploaded JSON or YAML, or a URL fetched through the SSRF\n  guard (5 MB cap); optional required-properties-only contracts\n- New consumer contracts on declared endpoints start from the spec, so the very\n  first response is checked; undeclared endpoints still learn from traffic\n- Spec-vs-contract comparison and \"use spec as contract\" (new contract version)\n- Dashboard OpenAPI panel on the service page\n- Integration suite covers import, validation, first-response drift and adoption","tree":{"sha":"7aaa6f651d41dc932239a49c68c3d7a3513812a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/git/trees/7aaa6f651d41dc932239a49c68c3d7a3513812a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/git/commits/f3a2914660ab00c23cbd0591503400ab1e4a9ba3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76534891?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","ht