ttps://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizan2002-npm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/commits/6b2650ec30f3450825fa1e1b9bd0aefdd016fb01/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T11:39:39Z","email":"faizanblink34@gmail.com","name":"Faizan Shamas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T11:39:39Z","email":"faizanblink34@gmail.com","name":"Faizan Shamas"},"message":"feat(policies): automatic canary promotion and rollback policies\n\n- promotion_policies scoped to org, service, consumer or both; the most\n  specific enabled policy wins\n- Pure decision engine (request/time thresholds, failure-rate limit, allowed\n  generators, evidence-gated auto-rollback) with unit tests\n- PolicyEvaluator runs every 30 s under a Redis lock (one instance at a time),\n  applies decisions through the audited governance paths as policy:<name>,\n  snapshots the evidence into canary_metrics and notifies members\n- API: CRUD [admin] and /policies/outlook [viewer]\n- Dashboard Policies page: per-patch progress meters and next step, policy\n  editor; live-refreshed on patch events\n- Seed adds a conservative Default policy to the Demo Organization\n- Integration suite covers promote, rollback, scoping, roles and the lock;\n  e2e visits the Policies page","tree":{"sha":"09fda173a507ede20af03302bfefe4c194b8cf42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/git/trees/09fda173a507ede20af03302bfefe4c194b8cf42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizan2002-npm/autonomous-mfe-orchestrator/git/commits/6b2650ec30f3450825fa1e1b9bd0aefdd016fb01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"v