},"message":"Docs as built: a user guide, the data model, operations, configuration and a glossary\n\nNew pages: User guide (every screen and the roles), Data model (where every kind of data lives\nand the main tables of each service), Operations (health, metrics, the Grafana dashboard, stuck\njobs, events, backups, troubleshooting), Configuration (the .env files, the settings that\nmatter, the workspace settings, before going live), Glossary. API Documentation now lists the\nREST routes, GraphQL operations, gRPC services and events that exist, instead of the first\nplan. The Introduction has the current repositories, status and reading order; Platform says\nwhat was built for sign-in; the README lists every page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f94db75d494b81a987ea24ad70bae5c7a7c644d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-docs/git/trees/f94db75d494b81a987ea24ad70bae5c7a7c644d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-docs/git/commits/d5e0783278affc002063b3eb88142290d11adb28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/likho-ai/likho-docs/commit/d5e0783278affc002063b3eb88142290d11adb28","node_id":"C_kwDOU29tztoAKGQ1ZTA3ODMyNzhhZmZjMDAyMDYzYjNlYjg4MTQyMjkwZDExYWRiMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/likho-ai/likho-docs/commit/bea9777805c2d3eab57787d33e157b02d3632fa7","sha":"bea9777805c2d3eab57787d33e157b02d3632fa7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-docs/commits/bea9777805c2d3eab57787d33e157b02d3632fa7"}],"sha":"d5e0783278affc002063b3eb88142290d11adb28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-docs/commits/d5e0783278affc002063b3eb88142290d11adb28"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-docs/commits/bea9777805c2d3eab57787d33e157b02d3632fa7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:33:48Z","email":"sandeep@soft